(1754772, 238898, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich blue tone on tone.  The dock with the single figure makes him look inconsequential, which I''m sure was your intent.  The enormity of the lake is captured well here.</td>', 'Beautiful rich blue tone on tone.  The dock with the single figure makes him look inconsequential, which I''m sure was your intent.  The enormity of the lake is captured well here.', '2005-10-03 01:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
