(1754779, 236691, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of it. I wish there were a bit more contrast.  I understand the old feel to it, but I think a bit of richness might help.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of it. I wish there were a bit more contrast.  I understand the old feel to it, but I think a bit of richness might help.', '2005-10-03 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754781, 238782, 28742, '<td valign="top">quite what? ...oh! Quite beautiful. :) A touch softer than I would prefer, but overall very nice.</td>', 'quite what? ...oh! Quite beautiful. :) A touch softer than I would prefer, but overall very nice.', '2005-10-03 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754787, 239232, 25397, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2005-10-03 01:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754795, 239275, 21362, '<td valign="top">I think I would''ve cropped out all the dark green foliage in the background completely out. It really doesn''t add anything to the image.<br/> <br/>I love the foreground scene. Great action shot, lovely muted colors.</td>', 'I think I would''ve cropped out all the dark green foliage in the background completely out. It really doesn''t add anything to the image. I love the foreground scene. Great action shot, lovely muted colors.', '2005-10-03 01:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754799, 239436, 21362, '<td valign="top">Hey, I know that city!</td>', 'Hey, I know that city!', '2005-10-03 01:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754800, 238786, 15711, '<td valign="top">What an awesome capture.  I love the clarity of his eyes.  The wind blowing his beard (or whatever you call that thing on his chest) gives it a sense of movement.  Great DOF.</td>', 'What an awesome capture.  I love the clarity of his eyes.  The wind blowing his beard (or whatever you call that thing on his chest) gives it a sense of movement.  Great DOF.', '2005-10-03 01:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754802, 239369, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a fun joyous sense. Great title. I love the one speck of color with her hot pink tee shirt. It gives it a WOW factor.  Great placement of the figure in the shot. I like this very much.</td>', 'This has a fun joyous sense. Great title. I love the one speck of color with her hot pink tee shirt. It gives it a WOW factor.  Great placement of the figure in the shot. I like this very much.', '2005-10-03 01:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754813, 238032, 15711, '<td valign="top">STUNNING.  The rich tonality of this is so eye catching.  That little touch of range makes the shot (along with the vertical vapor trail).  I love it.</td>', 'STUNNING.  The rich tonality of this is so eye catching.  That little touch of range makes the shot (along with the vertical vapor trail).  I love it.', '2005-10-03 01:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754819, 236791, 15711, '<td valign="top">Just lovely.  The night lights are beautifully reflected.  I might crop out the boat on the left, but other than that, a great shot!!!  Thanks for the invitation.</td>', 'Just lovely.  The night lights are beautifully reflected.  I might crop out the boat on the left, but other than that, a great shot!!!  Thanks for the invitation.', '2005-10-03 01:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754821, 237879, 34659, '<td valign="top">WoW!  This looks like it''s straight out of a fairy tale.  Truly beautiful dreamlike quality.  Fantastic focus and I love the tones.  Great job!</td>', 'WoW!  This looks like it''s straight out of a fairy tale.  Truly beautiful dreamlike quality.  Fantastic focus and I love the tones.  Great job!', '2005-10-03 01:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754824, 239305, 10867, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and tones!</td>', 'Lovely composition and tones!', '2005-10-03 01:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754829, 239371, 15711, '<td valign="top">You couldn''t have captured Cinderella''s castle any better. The beautiful water leading up to it with the rich blue tones is just spectacular!!!  WOW.  Perfect lighting and focus. The leading line just sends your eye right up to the castle!! The blue of the sky is stunning. My only critique is that it seems just ever so slightly unlevel. It could use the tiniest straightening by tilting to the left just a smidge.</td>', 'You couldn''t have captured Cinderella''s castle any better. The beautiful water leading up to it with the rich blue tones is just spectacular!!!  WOW.  Perfect lighting and focus. The leading line just sends your eye right up to the castle!! The blue of the sky is stunning. My only critique is that it seems just ever so slightly unlevel. It could use the tiniest straightening by tilting to the left just a smidge.', '2005-10-03 01:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754836, 239363, 10867, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the sky in this image is quite noisy and some parts of the pier and houses seem a tad blown out.  Lovely scene, though.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the sky in this image is quite noisy and some parts of the pier and houses seem a tad blown out.  Lovely scene, though.', '2005-10-03 01:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754841, 238537, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones.  I love the leading line of it.  Makes me want to hit the road and drive there.  I might''ve cloned out the pole and wires, but otherwise - Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful tones.  I love the leading line of it.  Makes me want to hit the road and drive there.  I might''ve cloned out the pole and wires, but otherwise - Nicely done.', '2005-10-03 01:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754845, 238051, 10867, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure.  I''d be tempted to crop out about an inch of sky, but I can see why you decided to leave it in, since cropping it out would have left you with an almost square format.</td>', 'Perfect exposure.  I''d be tempted to crop out about an inch of sky, but I can see why you decided to leave it in, since cropping it out would have left you with an almost square format.', '2005-10-03 01:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754859, 236666, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has beautiful tonality. Love the blues and greens. The water is like velvet. My only critique is that the bridge isn''t level.  I''d straighten it so that it''s parallel with the bottom edge of the photo.  Nice frame too!!</td>', 'This has beautiful tonality. Love the blues and greens. The water is like velvet. My only critique is that the bridge isn''t level.  I''d straighten it so that it''s parallel with the bottom edge of the photo.  Nice frame too!!', '2005-10-03 01:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
