(1755006, 239369, 10867, '<td valign="top">It may be an optical illusion, but the horizon looks just a tiny bilt tilted towards the left to me.  I think, too, that the image might be more effective if the girl were walking into the picture (at the left) rather than so close to out of it.  I like the idea behind this image very much, though.</td>', 'It may be an optical illusion, but the horizon looks just a tiny bilt tilted towards the left to me.  I think, too, that the image might be more effective if the girl were walking into the picture (at the left) rather than so close to out of it.  I like the idea behind this image very much, though.', '2005-10-03 03:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755007, 236666, 34763, '<td valign="top">very beautiful, I think the frame so far in detracts somewhat. I really like the photos</td>', 'very beautiful, I think the frame so far in detracts somewhat. I really like the photos', '2005-10-03 03:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755009, 238657, 36619, '<td valign="top">oh wow, real close to where i live. cute capture too.</td>', 'oh wow, real close to where i live. cute capture too.', '2005-10-03 03:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
