(1755012, 239234, 34763, '<td valign="top">the edges of the table and chairs seem a little over processed. The colors are bright and good setting.</td>', 'the edges of the table and chairs seem a little over processed. The colors are bright and good setting.', '2005-10-03 03:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
