(1755370, 236520, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect title.  The warm glow exudes a comforting  friendly feeling like a safehaven from the world around you.  I like the deep rich colors and softness of the light.  If this doesn''t suit corner then I don''t know what does!!!</td>', 'Perfect title.  The warm glow exudes a comforting  friendly feeling like a safehaven from the world around you.  I like the deep rich colors and softness of the light.  If this doesn''t suit corner then I don''t know what does!!!', '2005-10-03 09:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755372, 238669, 15711, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful Icelandic shot.  The dimmed hues of gray/brown and blue work in such a complementary fashion here.  I love the texture of their wool. It''s nice to have one "black sheep" thrown into the mix. hee hee  This really is outstanding.</td>', 'Another beautiful Icelandic shot.  The dimmed hues of gray/brown and blue work in such a complementary fashion here.  I love the texture of their wool. It''s nice to have one "black sheep" thrown into the mix. hee hee  This really is outstanding.', '2005-10-03 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755374, 239513, 43321, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  Very sharp and  brilliant gradient in the sky.</td>', 'nice shot.  Very sharp and  brilliant gradient in the sky.', '2005-10-03 09:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755376, 239201, 4477, '<td valign="top">Good composition and great colors.</td>', 'Good composition and great colors.', '2005-10-03 09:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755380, 238725, 43321, '<td valign="top">I dig the message.  Well put.  Your expression tells it all.</td>', 'I dig the message.  Well put.  Your expression tells it all.', '2005-10-03 09:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755382, 238420, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love that this is unexpected and not the typical landscape. The silhouette is perfect and this image and title couldn''t suit the challenge better. The placement of the figure is right where it should be in order to send the eye to it and give the sense of movement as you walk away, carrying the buckets.  Spot on lighting too. I even like that flare up in the rafters!!  The filter is that brown/gray that I like so much and it is the perfect addition to this image to really give it some POW. Good job. 9</td>', 'I love that this is unexpected and not the typical landscape. The silhouette is perfect and this image and title couldn''t suit the challenge better. The placement of the figure is right where it should be in order to send the eye to it and give the sense of movement as you walk away, carrying the buckets.  Spot on lighting too. I even like that flare up in the rafters!!  The filter is that brown/gray that I like so much and it is the perfect addition to this image to really give it some POW. Good job. 9', '2005-10-03 09:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755384, 239410, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice and unexpected. I love the high contrast and that ever so slight hint of green to the filter.  The pose is natural and unforced. The framing of the doorway around you is really good. The addition of the plants to the left add a nice textural touch. 8</td>', 'Very nice and unexpected. I love the high contrast and that ever so slight hint of green to the filter.  The pose is natural and unforced. The framing of the doorway around you is really good. The addition of the plants to the left add a nice textural touch. 8', '2005-10-03 09:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755385, 236793, 43321, '<td valign="top">Ansel?  Is that you??</td>', 'Ansel?  Is that you??', '2005-10-03 09:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755386, 237786, 4477, '<td valign="top">The different color lights really make this image work.  Good work.</td>', 'The different color lights really make this image work.  Good work.', '2005-10-03 10:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755388, 237869, 15711, '<td valign="top">This grabgbedt my eye immediately.  The movement of the waves on the jetty along with the cool color pallette is really quite eye catching. The city off in the distance (great use of rule of thirds too) helps give the eye a place to rest. The stop action of the crashing water on the rocks really is well done and the focus couldn''t be more crisp. 9</td>', 'This grabgbedt my eye immediately.  The movement of the waves on the jetty along with the cool color pallette is really quite eye catching. The city off in the distance (great use of rule of thirds too) helps give the eye a place to rest. The stop action of the crashing water on the rocks really is well done and the focus couldn''t be more crisp. 9', '2005-10-03 10:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755389, 237958, 4477, '<td valign="top">Really neat perspective!  Good choice in taking a night time shot.</td>', 'Really neat perspective!  Good choice in taking a night time shot.', '2005-10-03 10:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755391, 237668, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is one of those "make you feel good" shots.  The natural innocent pose is wonderful. I love the glow in the eyes.  Sepia is a fine choice for filters too as it gives a timeless mood and warms up that already cozy feeling even more. The one directional lighting bounces off of the face perfectly. I don''t even mind the piping on the cushion behind the head - as it serves as a frame to the face.</td>', 'This is one of those "make you feel good" shots.  The natural innocent pose is wonderful. I love the glow in the eyes.  Sepia is a fine choice for filters too as it gives a timeless mood and warms up that already cozy feeling even more. The one directional lighting bounces off of the face perfectly. I don''t even mind the piping on the cushion behind the head - as it serves as a frame to the face.', '2005-10-03 10:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755392, 238886, 43321, '<td valign="top">Yikes.</td>', 'Yikes.', '2005-10-03 10:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755393, 239334, 8377, '<td valign="top">wow, this is a gorgeous shot! The composition is perfect.  it makes me want to move there... :)</td>', 'wow, this is a gorgeous shot! The composition is perfect.  it makes me want to move there... :)', '2005-10-03 10:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755395, 238151, 4477, '<td valign="top">I  like this shot, but the foreground is distracting.  IMO it would look best without.  Just makes the mtns look as if they are floating.</td>', 'I  like this shot, but the foreground is distracting.  IMO it would look best without.  Just makes the mtns look as if they are floating.', '2005-10-03 10:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755396, 239429, 15711, '<td valign="top">Not only is this balloons, but a night shot as well!  Really nicely done.  I love that they are little spots of color up in the evening sky.  Great composition and lighting. Your eye just follows them all the way up to that final one at the top of the photo.  Good one.</td>', 'Not only is this balloons, but a night shot as well!  Really nicely done.  I love that they are little spots of color up in the evening sky.  Great composition and lighting. Your eye just follows them all the way up to that final one at the top of the photo.  Good one.', '2005-10-03 10:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755398, 237349, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like the tone on tone that this photo has.  The textures and colors of the rocks are almost identical to the one of the big cat.  I love his relaxed pose.  This image has a softness to it which I really like. Spot on!!!</td>', 'I really like the tone on tone that this photo has.  The textures and colors of the rocks are almost identical to the one of the big cat.  I love his relaxed pose.  This image has a softness to it which I really like. Spot on!!!', '2005-10-03 10:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755400, 239497, 4477, '<td valign="top">I like the layout of your image.</td>', 'I like the layout of your image.', '2005-10-03 10:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755401, 237349, 42181, '<td valign="top">Great eye contact.</td>', 'Great eye contact.', '2005-10-03 10:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755402, 239323, 43321, '<td valign="top">I hope this picture brings you good luck!  HA!  Color contrast is great.</td>', 'I hope this picture brings you good luck!  HA!  Color contrast is great.', '2005-10-03 10:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755403, 239323, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just love the red backdrop.  the DOF is good but the focus seems to be a bit stronger on the pilon than on the cat.  His eyes are a standout and his blue black coat is great against the backdrop of the old wood. 8</td>', 'I just love the red backdrop.  the DOF is good but the focus seems to be a bit stronger on the pilon than on the cat.  His eyes are a standout and his blue black coat is great against the backdrop of the old wood. 8', '2005-10-03 10:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755405, 238797, 4477, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Lighting, composition, and subject are all outstanding!  I am sure this will place very high!  Great job!  I''ve found another favorite!</td>', 'Beautiful!  Lighting, composition, and subject are all outstanding!  I am sure this will place very high!  Great job!  I''ve found another favorite!', '2005-10-03 10:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755410, 238079, 4477, '<td valign="top">I like your choice in selective desaturation.  The border adds a nice touch to this powerful image.</td>', 'I like your choice in selective desaturation.  The border adds a nice touch to this powerful image.', '2005-10-03 10:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755411, 239292, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting and I like the parallel horizontal quality of the Canadian flag and the needle.  Great ground up effect.  The focus is just so crisp and the contrast between the red and white of the flag and the rich blue of the sky has that WOW factor.  I like this alot.  The light flar give that final bit of zing to the shot. 8</td>', 'This is really interesting and I like the parallel horizontal quality of the Canadian flag and the needle.  Great ground up effect.  The focus is just so crisp and the contrast between the red and white of the flag and the rich blue of the sky has that WOW factor.  I like this alot.  The light flar give that final bit of zing to the shot. 8', '2005-10-03 10:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755412, 239345, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The simple cool blues and whites make for a lovely image. It''s like the sky is opening up! Nice use of lighting as well.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The simple cool blues and whites make for a lovely image. It''s like the sky is opening up! Nice use of lighting as well.', '2005-10-03 10:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755415, 239420, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the urban sense of this.  The lighting is spot on. The tilted angle of the chair and the unparallel horizon enhances the mood of the forgotten piece of furniture. 8</td>', 'I love the urban sense of this.  The lighting is spot on. The tilted angle of the chair and the unparallel horizon enhances the mood of the forgotten piece of furniture. 8', '2005-10-03 10:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755416, 237667, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. The leading line is well achieved. The rich blues with the hints of brown work so well as complementary colors. You couldn''t have created better clouds for this shot. 8</td>', 'I like this very much. The leading line is well achieved. The rich blues with the hints of brown work so well as complementary colors. You couldn''t have created better clouds for this shot. 8', '2005-10-03 10:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755419, 238753, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - the intensity of the sun and the colors is quite striking.  I love the single fisherman in his boat. The silhouette is so detailed. The shimmery water has so much color in it and the gold of the reflection - WOW</td>', 'Wow - the intensity of the sun and the colors is quite striking.  I love the single fisherman in his boat. The silhouette is so detailed. The shimmery water has so much color in it and the gold of the reflection - WOW', '2005-10-03 10:14:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1755420, 238725, 4477, '<td valign="top">Probably one of the most emotional photos I''ve come across on this site.</td>', 'Probably one of the most emotional photos I''ve come across on this site.', '2005-10-03 10:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755421, 238659, 43321, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective</td>', 'Nice perspective', '2005-10-03 10:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755424, 238486, 15711, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite landscapes. The rich colors and beautiful reflection is quite a piece of eye candy. Did you use a wide angle? The rounding of the sky works so well and I love the puffs of cottony clouds as the cap to the grassy and treed ground. So nice!!</td>', 'One of my favorite landscapes. The rich colors and beautiful reflection is quite a piece of eye candy. Did you use a wide angle? The rounding of the sky works so well and I love the puffs of cottony clouds as the cap to the grassy and treed ground. So nice!!', '2005-10-03 10:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755427, 238977, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of the cheetah family. Their spots are such a nice rounding effect amidst the lines of the grass and twigs in the foreground. Great DOF. The green of the grass is a nice addition to the otherwise warm color pallette.</td>', 'Lovely capture of the cheetah family. Their spots are such a nice rounding effect amidst the lines of the grass and twigs in the foreground. Great DOF. The green of the grass is a nice addition to the otherwise warm color pallette.', '2005-10-03 10:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755429, 238486, 43321, '<td valign="top">Cha-Ching!  Very nice!</td>', 'Cha-Ching!  Very nice!', '2005-10-03 10:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755430, 238921, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The warmth of the rocks against the sky of cirrus clouds is a great contrast. I like that the shadows are creeping along the ground too. The leading line of the rocks send your eye across the entire image.</td>', 'Very nice. The warmth of the rocks against the sky of cirrus clouds is a great contrast. I like that the shadows are creeping along the ground too. The leading line of the rocks send your eye across the entire image.', '2005-10-03 10:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755433, 238100, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the green of the rocks in the foreground. Great DOF.  The wave splashing on the rocks gives some movement to an otherwise still feeling of this shot. Great cool sky and water tones with the deep rocky contrast.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the green of the rocks in the foreground. Great DOF.  The wave splashing on the rocks gives some movement to an otherwise still feeling of this shot. Great cool sky and water tones with the deep rocky contrast.', '2005-10-03 10:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755434, 239232, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has that awww factor, without a child or puppy.  The warmth of the filter helps that along. I think the hands on each other are what make it. The lighting is good and the shadows on the shoulders is well done. 8</td>', 'This has that awww factor, without a child or puppy.  The warmth of the filter helps that along. I think the hands on each other are what make it. The lighting is good and the shadows on the shoulders is well done. 8', '2005-10-03 10:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755438, 239345, 4477, '<td valign="top">I love these landscapes.  Seems so quiet and serene, but with a bite. :-)</td>', 'I love these landscapes.  Seems so quiet and serene, but with a bite. :-)', '2005-10-03 10:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755440, 239403, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ya got me curious with the coordinates, so I had to dig out the map to find that this must be around Reykjavik somewhere :)</td>', 'Ya got me curious with the coordinates, so I had to dig out the map to find that this must be around Reykjavik somewhere :)', '2005-10-03 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755443, 239279, 4477, '<td valign="top">Very cute, though the overexposed spot on the cat''s head is distracting.</td>', 'Very cute, though the overexposed spot on the cat''s head is distracting.', '2005-10-03 10:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755447, 237094, 33256, '<td valign="top">Blown highlights. Out of focus. Odd filter or reflection. Maybe your going with an artistic vision but it doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'Blown highlights. Out of focus. Odd filter or reflection. Maybe your going with an artistic vision but it doesn''t do it for me.', '2005-10-03 10:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755455, 238925, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nice<br/> The warm rusty hues of the shore are a nice contrast to the lake color. I like that single old weathered tree trunk rising up out of the wate toor.  The composition is well done and the low perspective really works to lead your eye out into the water. Good focus and detail. 8</td>', 'Really nice The warm rusty hues of the shore are a nice contrast to the lake color. I like that single old weathered tree trunk rising up out of the wate toor.  The composition is well done and the low perspective really works to lead your eye out into the water. Good focus and detail. 8', '2005-10-03 10:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755457, 238056, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  The desat of color works. The title is perfect. The round table with the chairs around it helps to add some curvature to the otherwise linear geometry of the buiolding. 8</td>', 'I like this alot.  The desat of color works. The title is perfect. The round table with the chairs around it helps to add some curvature to the otherwise linear geometry of the buiolding. 8', '2005-10-03 10:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755461, 239416, 15711, '<td valign="top">The striations of the clouds in combination with the great contrast of the warm and cool tones gives this photo the SNAP that I like to see. I wish it were larger - it seems smaller than the 640 maximum allowance. I''d love to see more texture of the beautiful trees. Still a really eye catching landscape. 8</td>', 'The striations of the clouds in combination with the great contrast of the warm and cool tones gives this photo the SNAP that I like to see. I wish it were larger - it seems smaller than the 640 maximum allowance. I''d love to see more texture of the beautiful trees. Still a really eye catching landscape. 8', '2005-10-03 10:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755465, 239199, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective and unexpected with the tables and chairs in shadow.  I think the dim tones of the front area help to ground the entire shot. The contrast of the well lit white tabernacle really sends your eye right to it.  Good composition and detail without being too busy. 8</td>', 'Very nice perspective and unexpected with the tables and chairs in shadow.  I think the dim tones of the front area help to ground the entire shot. The contrast of the well lit white tabernacle really sends your eye right to it.  Good composition and detail without being too busy. 8', '2005-10-03 10:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755467, 239282, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot. The clouds seem a tad out of focus to me. Good placement of the monument.</td>', 'Nice simple shot. The clouds seem a tad out of focus to me. Good placement of the monument.', '2005-10-03 10:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755470, 238846, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the single leaf on the rock.  It makes the shot.  It gives a focal point to an otherwise "ordinary" setting. I like the title too. 7</td>', 'I like the single leaf on the rock.  It makes the shot.  It gives a focal point to an otherwise "ordinary" setting. I like the title too. 7', '2005-10-03 10:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755479, 239271, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting and the color contrast is great.  I like the striations of the foreground and the curve of the arch really hads a nice roundness to it.  I like that it''s not perfectly parallel too.  The perspective gives it a bit of an edge.  If it were me, I''d up the cyan saturation even more for an even more vivid sky.  Good job. 7</td>', 'This is really interesting and the color contrast is great.  I like the striations of the foreground and the curve of the arch really hads a nice roundness to it.  I like that it''s not perfectly parallel too.  The perspective gives it a bit of an edge.  If it were me, I''d up the cyan saturation even more for an even more vivid sky.  Good job. 7', '2005-10-03 10:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755485, 238730, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this. The softness of it is appealing and the light is well achieved.  It''s different and not the expected, which I appreciate.  The black and white filter really works and uncomplicates it by just having an overall grayed palette. Nice self portrait!!! ;~)</td>', 'I like this. The softness of it is appealing and the light is well achieved.  It''s different and not the expected, which I appreciate.  The black and white filter really works and uncomplicates it by just having an overall grayed palette. Nice self portrait!!! ;~)', '2005-10-03 10:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755486, 238484, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the upside down perspective. The leading line is interesting as well.</td>', 'I like the upside down perspective. The leading line is interesting as well.', '2005-10-03 10:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755490, 239257, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great composition and perspective. It could have a snapshot sense but doesn''t due to the excellent lighting and filtration.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great composition and perspective. It could have a snapshot sense but doesn''t due to the excellent lighting and filtration.  Nicely done.', '2005-10-03 10:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755494, 238132, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the repeated cacti. It gives your eye a kind of bounce around, without being too busy, as they are all basically the same.  I like the greens and blues of the landscape as well. Beautiful sky!! 7</td>', 'I like the repeated cacti. It gives your eye a kind of bounce around, without being too busy, as they are all basically the same.  I like the greens and blues of the landscape as well. Beautiful sky!! 7', '2005-10-03 10:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755496, 239302, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. The leading line of the rocks is nice and works effectively as you chose the right perspective. Interesting detail in the foreground too.  The blue of the mountains in the background draw your eye to them.</td>', 'Very pretty. The leading line of the rocks is nice and works effectively as you chose the right perspective. Interesting detail in the foreground too.  The blue of the mountains in the background draw your eye to them.', '2005-10-03 10:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755503, 237297, 33960, '<td valign="top">can''t see the connection to corners</td>', 'can''t see the connection to corners', '2005-10-03 10:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755504, 238033, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and soothing with the violet blue water and yellow sky and brown sand. I think if this had a single figure, be it a bird, a person, an object somewhere in it, that would really give it the POW that would make it a ribbon winner. It would give a true focal point to the photo.  The composition is beautiful and the touch of clouds here and there are a nice touch. ;~) good job</td>', 'Very pretty and soothing with the violet blue water and yellow sky and brown sand. I think if this had a single figure, be it a bird, a person, an object somewhere in it, that would really give it the POW that would make it a ribbon winner. It would give a true focal point to the photo.  The composition is beautiful and the touch of clouds here and there are a nice touch. ;~) good job', '2005-10-03 10:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755507, 239530, 33960, '<td valign="top">where''s the corner</td>', 'where''s the corner', '2005-10-03 10:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755509, 239281, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. The reflective quality of the water is nice. It seems just a touch overexposed.  I might have removed, or cloned out the structure in the foreground as it is a bit distracting. Maybe play with curves a bit. I like the blue tone of the cliff against the green/yellow of the trees.</td>', 'Very pretty. The reflective quality of the water is nice. It seems just a touch overexposed.  I might have removed, or cloned out the structure in the foreground as it is a bit distracting. Maybe play with curves a bit. I like the blue tone of the cliff against the green/yellow of the trees.', '2005-10-03 10:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755510, 238143, 33960, '<td valign="top">too many distractions, don''t you think??</td>', 'too many distractions, don''t you think??', '2005-10-03 10:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755512, 239529, 34192, '<td valign="top">Must be Ohio. :)  I like the composition but I wish there was a little less ''fog/smog/lack of contrast" in the upper half of the image.  6</td>', 'Must be Ohio. :)  I like the composition but I wish there was a little less ''fog/smog/lack of contrast" in the upper half of the image.  6', '2005-10-03 10:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755515, 237877, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really fun and interesting.  I like the round and straight combination.  The sky is a great backdrop to the image. The reflective quality of the silver orbs is fun and has some whimsy.</td>', 'Really fun and interesting.  I like the round and straight combination.  The sky is a great backdrop to the image. The reflective quality of the silver orbs is fun and has some whimsy.', '2005-10-03 10:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755516, 239323, 35804, '<td valign="top">Really nice! Love that black beauty positioned next to the barn red...well done.</td>', 'Really nice! Love that black beauty positioned next to the barn red...well done.', '2005-10-03 10:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755517, 239352, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice pastoral setting. The light seems just a touch harsh. The house in the foreground helps to anchor the shot.  I wish I could see the sheep better. I''m such a sucker for animal shots. The leading line of the road is nice and gives your eye a path to follow.</td>', 'Nice pastoral setting. The light seems just a touch harsh. The house in the foreground helps to anchor the shot.  I wish I could see the sheep better. I''m such a sucker for animal shots. The leading line of the road is nice and gives your eye a path to follow.', '2005-10-03 10:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755518, 239443, 34192, '<td valign="top">This would be a really great shot in my opinion if oyu had been able to get rid of the cars.  I like the slight blur/glow and the tones.</td>', 'This would be a really great shot in my opinion if oyu had been able to get rid of the cars.  I like the slight blur/glow and the tones.', '2005-10-03 10:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755520, 239424, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely vivid colors.  I love the silhouettes of the palm trees with the hints of light here and there in the background.  Great reflection. The clarity is spot on.</td>', 'Lovely vivid colors.  I love the silhouettes of the palm trees with the hints of light here and there in the background.  Great reflection. The clarity is spot on.', '2005-10-03 10:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755521, 239273, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and variation of color. The wiggly line of the water draws your eye to the mountains in the background.</td>', 'Nice detail and variation of color. The wiggly line of the water draws your eye to the mountains in the background.', '2005-10-03 11:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755524, 238132, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love AZ!  NIce comp.  I know there''s more pop in those greens somewhere.  A little sharper would be nice too.</td>', 'I love AZ!  NIce comp.  I know there''s more pop in those greens somewhere.  A little sharper would be nice too.', '2005-10-03 11:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755525, 236666, 34192, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the border - I find it distracting.  Beautiful image with wonderful glow.  The bridge looks slightly out of level. 7</td>', 'I don''t care for the border - I find it distracting.  Beautiful image with wonderful glow.  The bridge looks slightly out of level. 7', '2005-10-03 11:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755526, 238079, 15711, '<td valign="top">I remember seeing this shot, or a similar one earlier. Hmmmm <br/> <br/>I like the forlorned look on the little one''s face. Not overly crazy about the desat, but it does make her stand out amidst the busy legs and feet. Her eyes are beautiful. I wish I could see them again in a portrait shot!! ;~)</td>', 'I remember seeing this shot, or a similar one earlier. Hmmmm  I like the forlorned look on the little one''s face. Not overly crazy about the desat, but it does make her stand out amidst the busy legs and feet. Her eyes are beautiful. I wish I could see them again in a portrait shot!! ;~)', '2005-10-03 11:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755528, 237853, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty but a tad "ordinary." I wish the sun weren''t so dead center.  Maybe an object, person, or bird, would off set it and give your eye another place to rest. and counterbalance the bullseye effect of the sun''s placement.  The deep blues are quite soothing.</td>', 'Very pretty but a tad "ordinary." I wish the sun weren''t so dead center.  Maybe an object, person, or bird, would off set it and give your eye another place to rest. and counterbalance the bullseye effect of the sun''s placement.  The deep blues are quite soothing.', '2005-10-03 11:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755529, 237186, 33960, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2005-10-03 11:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755531, 238240, 35804, '<td valign="top">Fantastic light...very nice.</td>', 'Fantastic light...very nice.', '2005-10-03 11:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755532, 238889, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great complementary colors<br/> The sky color is awesome. I like that bit of wispy cirrus clouds too. If this had a single object or something in the foreground, it might help ground the landscape.  Don''t get me wrong, this is spot on, but that''s just my personal preference. Is this Colorado?  Very pretty.</td>', 'Great complementary colors The sky color is awesome. I like that bit of wispy cirrus clouds too. If this had a single object or something in the foreground, it might help ground the landscape.  Don''t get me wrong, this is spot on, but that''s just my personal preference. Is this Colorado?  Very pretty.', '2005-10-03 11:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755533, 239408, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love Niagra!!!  Great shot. Well controlled exposure.</td>', 'I love Niagra!!!  Great shot. Well controlled exposure.', '2005-10-03 11:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755535, 238115, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot.  The colors are rich and the focus is good. I think it is missing something. Maybe a silhouette, or a bird or something to give your eye a true focal point. I might crop out that post on the left and just have the one dark one in the background.</td>', 'Nice simple shot.  The colors are rich and the focus is good. I think it is missing something. Maybe a silhouette, or a bird or something to give your eye a true focal point. I might crop out that post on the left and just have the one dark one in the background.', '2005-10-03 11:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755536, 239428, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and soothing. I like the red flowers in the foreground. The velvety water is very peaceful  indeed.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Very pretty and soothing. I like the red flowers in the foreground. The velvety water is very peaceful  indeed.  Nicely composed.', '2005-10-03 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755537, 239522, 35804, '<td valign="top">....perfect...so good...well imagined.</td>', '....perfect...so good...well imagined.', '2005-10-03 11:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755539, 239554, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like shots like this...nice.</td>', 'I really like shots like this...nice.', '2005-10-03 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755540, 238498, 35804, '<td valign="top">...really really nice...quite wonderful in fact...that slash of deep purple is perfection...again...fantastic shot.</td>', '...really really nice...quite wonderful in fact...that slash of deep purple is perfection...again...fantastic shot.', '2005-10-03 11:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755542, 238484, 33960, '<td valign="top">is this upside down??</td>', 'is this upside down??', '2005-10-03 11:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755548, 238498, 36619, '<td valign="top">it almost looks like an abstract painting. i like the blues in this they remind me of denim.</td>', 'it almost looks like an abstract painting. i like the blues in this they remind me of denim.', '2005-10-03 11:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755554, 238931, 36619, '<td valign="top">very cool angle, and all the elements of this work so well together.</td>', 'very cool angle, and all the elements of this work so well together.', '2005-10-03 11:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755555, 238417, 30669, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. Love the low sun light shinning on the cow and the one''s grazing in background give the photo depth and balance.  Well done.   9</td>', 'I really like this photo. Love the low sun light shinning on the cow and the one''s grazing in background give the photo depth and balance.  Well done.   9', '2005-10-03 11:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
