(1755639, 239148, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great detail and close up.  I like the crop you chose.  Some might find it too tight, but I''m a fan of "in your face" portraits that exclude some of the edges. The lighting on his nose works well.</td>', 'Great detail and close up.  I like the crop you chose.  Some might find it too tight, but I''m a fan of "in your face" portraits that exclude some of the edges. The lighting on his nose works well.', '2005-10-03 12:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
