(1755645, 239397, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m a huge fan of fence shots.  I love the weathered old post in the foreground on the left. The barbed wire''s irregularity is a great textural issue and the leading line works perfectly. The golden tones of the grasses work well against the green of the  hill and beautiful blue sky.</td>', 'I''m a huge fan of fence shots.  I love the weathered old post in the foreground on the left. The barbed wire''s irregularity is a great textural issue and the leading line works perfectly. The golden tones of the grasses work well against the green of the  hill and beautiful blue sky.', '2005-10-03 12:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
