(1755648, 238803, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. The snowy egret makes the shot and grounds it. I love the cool and warm tones of the grasses and trees.  The reflection is beautiful. Did you adjust curves? It might deepen the tones even further.  Something fun to try.</td>', 'Very pretty. The snowy egret makes the shot and grounds it. I love the cool and warm tones of the grasses and trees.  The reflection is beautiful. Did you adjust curves? It might deepen the tones even further.  Something fun to try.', '2005-10-03 12:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
