(1755655, 239518, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely leading line. I like how the shadows of the grass add a horizontal touch. Nice lighting and the blue sky is a great contrast. I wonder if you upped the cyan a bit and even made it richer?  Hmmm - just a thought.</td>', 'Lovely leading line. I like how the shadows of the grass add a horizontal touch. Nice lighting and the blue sky is a great contrast. I wonder if you upped the cyan a bit and even made it richer?  Hmmm - just a thought.', '2005-10-03 12:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755656, 239474, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  The figure of the man makes and grounds the shot. I like the tonality and his skin tones against the gray of the boards.  Nicely done. Maybe a touch out of focus on him, but the overall composition and lighting is good.</td>', 'I like this alot.  The figure of the man makes and grounds the shot. I like the tonality and his skin tones against the gray of the boards.  Nicely done. Maybe a touch out of focus on him, but the overall composition and lighting is good.', '2005-10-03 12:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
