(1755716, 239533, 13026, '<td valign="top">Yes, to fit the DPC "style" here, you''d definitely have to have dodged and burned that sky a bunch...Sigh.<br/> <br/>I do like it...but you''re right, it''s not going to fit here.  And that''s really sad.  People are going to look at this for their two seconds and say, Ah, the skies don''t look like Heida''s, here''s your four.<br/> <br/>I really don''t know what else to say, man.  DPC has gotten rather disappointing in the last few months.  And just because your style doesn''t work with DPC''s style, you''re gonna get slammed.  That''s not very cool.<br/> <br/>Well, good luck, I hope your score goes up.  :)  Keep shooting SDG, yeah?</td>', 'Yes, to fit the DPC "style" here, you''d definitely have to have dodged and burned that sky a bunch...Sigh. I do like it...but you''re right, it''s not going to fit here.  And that''s really sad.  People are going to look at this for their two seconds and say, Ah, the skies don''t look like Heida''s, here''s your four. I really don''t know what else to say, man.  DPC has gotten rather disappointing in the last few months.  And just because your style doesn''t work with DPC''s style, you''re gonna get slammed.  That''s not very cool. Well, good luck, I hope your score goes up.  :)  Keep shooting SDG, yeah?', '2005-10-03 13:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
