(1757737, 237922, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. What a difference in the doors.</td>', 'Interesting picture. What a difference in the doors.', '2005-10-04 09:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757745, 238790, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Not sure what I am looking at. Having a hard time tying the title to the picture. Almost looks like old ways vs newer.  Didn''t ding you on the score for my lack of interpretation. Its still a good picture. Composed well.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Not sure what I am looking at. Having a hard time tying the title to the picture. Almost looks like old ways vs newer.  Didn''t ding you on the score for my lack of interpretation. Its still a good picture. Composed well.', '2005-10-04 09:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757747, 239174, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. I think we have the same clock. Its a bit dark which makes it hard to appreciate some detail.</td>', 'Interesting picture. I think we have the same clock. Its a bit dark which makes it hard to appreciate some detail.', '2005-10-04 09:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757748, 238650, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful country. Love the angle of this shot.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful country. Love the angle of this shot.', '2005-10-04 09:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757751, 239541, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape with great colors. A little bit over-treated for my liking but a wonderful piece.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape with great colors. A little bit over-treated for my liking but a wonderful piece.', '2005-10-04 09:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757752, 237970, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very cute and innocent. nice golden reflection from the sun.</td>', 'Very cute and innocent. nice golden reflection from the sun.', '2005-10-04 09:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757755, 239391, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Interesting picture. I''ve never seen a sky like that, awesome. Love the smaller building you left in here, really gives the scale of these buildings</td>', 'Wow, Interesting picture. I''ve never seen a sky like that, awesome. Love the smaller building you left in here, really gives the scale of these buildings', '2005-10-04 09:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757756, 239234, 42638, '<td valign="top">What a pleasant porch. Love the framing and the flower on the bottom righ really invites you in. The left bunch give it a sense of calm. The white chair is a bit distracting. The color just throws a curve into it all.</td>', 'What a pleasant porch. Love the framing and the flower on the bottom righ really invites you in. The left bunch give it a sense of calm. The white chair is a bit distracting. The color just throws a curve into it all.', '2005-10-04 09:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757758, 236691, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Its almost depressing and lonely. Would love to see this one in color.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Its almost depressing and lonely. Would love to see this one in color.', '2005-10-04 09:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757759, 238888, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. A bit too much going on with it. Would like to see the plane or the city but both is difficult. Love the clouds and sky. Great colors.</td>', 'Interesting picture. A bit too much going on with it. Would like to see the plane or the city but both is difficult. Love the clouds and sky. Great colors.', '2005-10-04 10:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757764, 239425, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on this challenge. Its amazing how much time we spend a day experiencing  this very same place. We tend to get numb to it.</td>', 'Interesting take on this challenge. Its amazing how much time we spend a day experiencing  this very same place. We tend to get numb to it.', '2005-10-04 10:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757768, 237551, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a dark corner. Love the cliff line and the cloud cover is great. Good job with the subtle lights coming out of the horizon.</td>', 'Wow, this is a dark corner. Love the cliff line and the cloud cover is great. Good job with the subtle lights coming out of the horizon.', '2005-10-04 10:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757769, 239429, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Love the balloons. Night time is the best viewing in my opinion. Like how you caught the city lights too. Really puts a perspective on their size.</td>', 'Wow, Love the balloons. Night time is the best viewing in my opinion. Like how you caught the city lights too. Really puts a perspective on their size.', '2005-10-04 10:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757774, 239483, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, the colors are great and the reflection is like a mirror. The sky is a bit washed though. Looking at the reflection, it should be "bluer".</td>', 'Wow, the colors are great and the reflection is like a mirror. The sky is a bit washed though. Looking at the reflection, it should be "bluer".', '2005-10-04 10:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757775, 239461, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, great landscape shot.</td>', 'Wow, great landscape shot.', '2005-10-04 10:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757778, 238710, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. So many trees. I live in the desert so don''t get much color change here. It always fascinates me. Love the few pines in there too.</td>', 'Interesting picture. So many trees. I live in the desert so don''t get much color change here. It always fascinates me. Love the few pines in there too.', '2005-10-04 10:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
