(1757782, 237762, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. I don''t really like the colors too well but love the immensity of it.</td>', 'Interesting picture. I don''t really like the colors too well but love the immensity of it.', '2005-10-04 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
