(1758042, 238240, 40295, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that I am missing something - I think there may be a bit too much cropped from the top of the image. The top of the structure on the right is missing and I want the walkway and the stream to take me somewhere and can''t find it - so I am left hanging.</td>', 'I get the feeling that I am missing something - I think there may be a bit too much cropped from the top of the image. The top of the structure on the right is missing and I want the walkway and the stream to take me somewhere and can''t find it - so I am left hanging.', '2005-10-04 12:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
