(1758565, 238053, 24642, '<td valign="top">Intruders.<br/>Very dramatic, i like the coloring.</td>', 'Intruders.Very dramatic, i like the coloring.', '2005-10-04 17:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758569, 239541, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the flow and the distorted view.</td>', 'I like the flow and the distorted view.', '2005-10-04 17:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758570, 237349, 31742, '<td valign="top">10..........Great shot !!</td>', '10..........Great shot !!', '2005-10-04 17:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758572, 239323, 31742, '<td valign="top">Wow beautiful colors!!!!...looks like a good halloween shot.........10</td>', 'Wow beautiful colors!!!!...looks like a good halloween shot.........10', '2005-10-04 17:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758581, 239349, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very tense composition that is almost impossible to view as a whole.  I really like the lower part but the upper half somehow doesn''t catch me.</td>', 'A very tense composition that is almost impossible to view as a whole.  I really like the lower part but the upper half somehow doesn''t catch me.', '2005-10-04 17:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758591, 238032, 24642, '<td valign="top">This seems like a nice small planet.  <br/>Very creative post processing work.  The warm colors on the left are great and give the image along with the vertical line in the sky a great visual punch.  <br/>One of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'This seems like a nice small planet.  Very creative post processing work.  The warm colors on the left are great and give the image along with the vertical line in the sky a great visual punch.  One of my favorites in the challenge.', '2005-10-04 17:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758592, 238041, 35545, '<td valign="top">A glimpse into hell.</td>', 'A glimpse into hell.', '2005-10-04 17:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758600, 237963, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the trees and the distribution of the animals.  The composition feels a bit unbalanced.  Perhaps the image would benefit by cropping of some of the sky.</td>', 'I like the color of the trees and the distribution of the animals.  The composition feels a bit unbalanced.  Perhaps the image would benefit by cropping of some of the sky.', '2005-10-04 17:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758612, 239223, 35545, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this picture very much.  I would probably have cropped in more closely and gotten rid of the sky and trees at the top.</td>', 'I like the feel of this picture very much.  I would probably have cropped in more closely and gotten rid of the sky and trees at the top.', '2005-10-04 17:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758616, 238890, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good light and composition.  IMHO you could have cropped out some of the top and made the image more compact.</td>', 'Good light and composition.  IMHO you could have cropped out some of the top and made the image more compact.', '2005-10-04 17:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758620, 237541, 35804, '<td valign="top">Love the light in this one...very nice.</td>', 'Love the light in this one...very nice.', '2005-10-04 17:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758625, 238890, 35804, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous and oh so dainty...there are soooooooo many things I like about this image...such a nicely done interior image.</td>', 'Gorgeous and oh so dainty...there are soooooooo many things I like about this image...such a nicely done interior image.', '2005-10-04 17:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758630, 239437, 35804, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic visage...the B &amp; W is perfect...well done.</td>', 'Nice dramatic visage...the B & W is perfect...well done.', '2005-10-04 17:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758633, 239403, 35804, '<td valign="top">10...that''s all I have to say...10</td>', '10...that''s all I have to say...10', '2005-10-04 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758636, 238484, 36808, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the water is so pristine, it makes a perfect mirror.  Great job!</td>', 'The reflection on the water is so pristine, it makes a perfect mirror.  Great job!', '2005-10-04 17:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758637, 239174, 35804, '<td valign="top">ooo! I like this! I like this ALOT! So mysterious...I can almost hear it...</td>', 'ooo! I like this! I like this ALOT! So mysterious...I can almost hear it...', '2005-10-04 17:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758644, 238417, 24642, '<td valign="top">Powerful composition with interesting tension.  The colours and the lighting are brilliant.  The only thing that bothers me is the sharpening halo around the animal on the left.</td>', 'Powerful composition with interesting tension.  The colours and the lighting are brilliant.  The only thing that bothers me is the sharpening halo around the animal on the left.', '2005-10-04 17:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758659, 238963, 21362, '<td valign="top">I would have slowed the shutter speed down here. You''ve got enough motion blur here to give... blur. A little bit more would''ve given that nice dreamy soft look to the water.</td>', 'I would have slowed the shutter speed down here. You''ve got enough motion blur here to give... blur. A little bit more would''ve given that nice dreamy soft look to the water.', '2005-10-04 17:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758660, 239170, 21362, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Very nice natural framing.</td>', 'Pretty. Very nice natural framing.', '2005-10-04 17:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758667, 238996, 21362, '<td valign="top">Oh man, now that song will be in my head the rest of the day! Kookaburra sits in a the old gum tree...<br/> <br/>Nice subject. It''s a little static the way it''s dead center like that though.</td>', 'Oh man, now that song will be in my head the rest of the day! Kookaburra sits in a the old gum tree... Nice subject. It''s a little static the way it''s dead center like that though.', '2005-10-04 17:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758670, 237783, 21362, '<td valign="top">Is 347 really the most important subject in this photo?</td>', 'Is 347 really the most important subject in this photo?', '2005-10-04 17:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758683, 238797, 21362, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors. I would have preferred the full reflection be visible, if possible. Or maybe a little more foreground, shoreline if that''s all there was just outside the frame there. That plant on the left side seems a little out of place, but if there was some foliage all along the base of the image it might have been nice. I don''t know, I guess it depends what the actual location was like. Hopefully you did the best you could with what was there. :) It''s very pretty, regardless. I''d love to know what your settings had to be to get both that color, and the stars!</td>', 'Pretty colors. I would have preferred the full reflection be visible, if possible. Or maybe a little more foreground, shoreline if that''s all there was just outside the frame there. That plant on the left side seems a little out of place, but if there was some foliage all along the base of the image it might have been nice. I don''t know, I guess it depends what the actual location was like. Hopefully you did the best you could with what was there. :) It''s very pretty, regardless. I''d love to know what your settings had to be to get both that color, and the stars!', '2005-10-04 17:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758685, 238486, 21362, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors!</td>', 'Gorgeous colors!', '2005-10-04 17:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758695, 236691, 21362, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I''m not sure this particular peachy hue works for me. I''d also decenter it a bit. Beautiful subject though.</td>', 'Hmm... I''m not sure this particular peachy hue works for me. I''d also decenter it a bit. Beautiful subject though.', '2005-10-04 18:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758740, 236666, 33256, '<td valign="top">Georgeous photo but I find the frame distracting.</td>', 'Georgeous photo but I find the frame distracting.', '2005-10-04 18:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758741, 238393, 25754, '<td valign="top">wow this is an  incredible capture.</td>', 'wow this is an  incredible capture.', '2005-10-04 18:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
