(1758758, 239279, 25754, '<td valign="top">cute content kitty! focus is a bit soft (IMO) and the bright spot on the head detracts.</td>', 'cute content kitty! focus is a bit soft (IMO) and the bright spot on the head detracts.', '2005-10-04 18:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758760, 239147, 25754, '<td valign="top">Might be a bit too out of context, focusing on such a small area of the truck. That said, I like the tone, texture and old gauges.</td>', 'Might be a bit too out of context, focusing on such a small area of the truck. That said, I like the tone, texture and old gauges.', '2005-10-04 18:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758762, 239228, 25754, '<td valign="top">nice lines and perspective. your title makes me wish i could see some green in that grass!</td>', 'nice lines and perspective. your title makes me wish i could see some green in that grass!', '2005-10-04 18:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758769, 239439, 25754, '<td valign="top">i like the post-proc here. a nice dreamy effect. also like the saturated colours.</td>', 'i like the post-proc here. a nice dreamy effect. also like the saturated colours.', '2005-10-04 18:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758771, 238115, 25754, '<td valign="top">colours are nice. peaceful scene. just not much point of interest here.</td>', 'colours are nice. peaceful scene. just not much point of interest here.', '2005-10-04 18:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758785, 237094, 25754, '<td valign="top">i''m sure you''re getting a few comments on this one :) personally i love the bold editing here. very artistic!</td>', 'i''m sure you''re getting a few comments on this one :) personally i love the bold editing here. very artistic!', '2005-10-04 18:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758788, 239302, 25754, '<td valign="top">great rugged landscape. this might have worked better as a duotone. still, great shot!</td>', 'great rugged landscape. this might have worked better as a duotone. still, great shot!', '2005-10-04 18:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758794, 237783, 25754, '<td valign="top">this is nice. shallow DOF is really effective here. colours could be a tad punchier (just my taste).</td>', 'this is nice. shallow DOF is really effective here. colours could be a tad punchier (just my taste).', '2005-10-04 19:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758797, 239258, 25754, '<td valign="top">this is great! i love how you''ve isolated the wheel and ice cream stand in what was probably a really busy scene.</td>', 'this is great! i love how you''ve isolated the wheel and ice cream stand in what was probably a really busy scene.', '2005-10-04 19:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758801, 237472, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the viewpoint.</td>', 'I like the colors and the viewpoint.', '2005-10-04 19:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758802, 239461, 24642, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene.<br/>I think there should be exceptions in the rules for panoramic format shots that allows them to be 800 pixel wide.  I can imagine that this looks brilliant full screen.</td>', 'A beautiful scene.I think there should be exceptions in the rules for panoramic format shots that allows them to be 800 pixel wide.  I can imagine that this looks brilliant full screen.', '2005-10-04 19:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758808, 239305, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very strong photograph.  Brilliant lighting and dynamic well balanced composition.  Post processing looks very professional leaving details in all areas.<br/>Top marks.</td>', 'A very strong photograph.  Brilliant lighting and dynamic well balanced composition.  Post processing looks very professional leaving details in all areas.Top marks.', '2005-10-04 19:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758813, 238056, 36619, '<td valign="top">everything has a fantastic rustic look and feel in this. very interesting photo. 10</td>', 'everything has a fantastic rustic look and feel in this. very interesting photo. 10', '2005-10-04 19:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758815, 239518, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and good composition.  Seems to lack sharpness in the distant rocks.</td>', 'Nice lighting and good composition.  Seems to lack sharpness in the distant rocks.', '2005-10-04 19:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758819, 239397, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice textures, colors and light.  Composition is good.  Seems to lack some depth.</td>', 'Nice textures, colors and light.  Composition is good.  Seems to lack some depth.', '2005-10-04 19:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758820, 238952, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the smooth flowing composition.  The colors are appealing and the clouds add a bit of drama.</td>', 'I like the smooth flowing composition.  The colors are appealing and the clouds add a bit of drama.', '2005-10-04 19:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758831, 239227, 33481, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but if it could have been sharper and more detailed, I would have liked it better.  Also, the color of the water doesn''t look real, but a very nice perspective never the less.</td>', 'I really like this shot, but if it could have been sharper and more detailed, I would have liked it better.  Also, the color of the water doesn''t look real, but a very nice perspective never the less.', '2005-10-04 19:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758832, 239416, 33481, '<td valign="top">love the color of the grass and leaves in contrast with the sky.  I think this is an amazing photo.</td>', 'love the color of the grass and leaves in contrast with the sky.  I think this is an amazing photo.', '2005-10-04 19:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758845, 239552, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Good use of the rule of thirds - and a real family keep sake.  Nicely done!  You have a nice corner.  :-)</td>', 'Great shot!  Good use of the rule of thirds - and a real family keep sake.  Nicely done!  You have a nice corner.  :-)', '2005-10-04 19:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758848, 238486, 40019, '<td valign="top">Love the colors - they just jump out at you!</td>', 'Love the colors - they just jump out at you!', '2005-10-04 19:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758860, 238725, 40019, '<td valign="top">Ok, you moved me - that''s what good photography is all about.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Ok, you moved me - that''s what good photography is all about.  Nicely done.', '2005-10-04 19:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758864, 238640, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Almost looks more like a painting than a photograph.</td>', 'Great colors.  Almost looks more like a painting than a photograph.', '2005-10-04 19:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758865, 238804, 33481, '<td valign="top">Hey, great framing, it makes the town look so tiny.  and I really like the color of the sky.</td>', 'Hey, great framing, it makes the town look so tiny.  and I really like the color of the sky.', '2005-10-04 19:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
