(1764699, 237783, 6519, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of the challenge and a beautiful photo! I''m not a sports fan, but you are really telling a story here, well done!</td>', 'Great interpretation of the challenge and a beautiful photo! I''m not a sports fan, but you are really telling a story here, well done!', '2005-10-06 13:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764700, 238790, 6519, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this in color!</td>', 'I would love to see this in color!', '2005-10-06 13:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764703, 239515, 6519, '<td valign="top">Nice, but if it was straight, it would be even better!</td>', 'Nice, but if it was straight, it would be even better!', '2005-10-06 13:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764712, 239294, 6519, '<td valign="top">That is YOUR corner? You must have quite the commute every day! Stunning spot, though.</td>', 'That is YOUR corner? You must have quite the commute every day! Stunning spot, though.', '2005-10-06 13:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764717, 239305, 6519, '<td valign="top">Ansel Adams, eat your heart out! Awesome photo, and yet I still can''t help but wonder what it REALLY looks like, i.e. in color......</td>', 'Ansel Adams, eat your heart out! Awesome photo, and yet I still can''t help but wonder what it REALLY looks like, i.e. in color......', '2005-10-06 13:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764788, 239420, 45509, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this photo!  It illustrates that for some people, life is just across the bridge if only they could get to it.  Depression, loneliness, homelessness - Life on the other side. Maybe the chair is empty because the person who sits in it is already on their way to the other side - towards life....or death?  A very evocative shot!</td>', 'I LOVE this photo!  It illustrates that for some people, life is just across the bridge if only they could get to it.  Depression, loneliness, homelessness - Life on the other side. Maybe the chair is empty because the person who sits in it is already on their way to the other side - towards life....or death?  A very evocative shot!', '2005-10-06 13:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764800, 238755, 39243, '<td valign="top">good photo - good colors - nice composition.</td>', 'good photo - good colors - nice composition.', '2005-10-06 13:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764863, 239458, 33679, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, it''s cosy. I love the colorful boots in the foreground, however I would have liked them to be in focus.</td>', 'I really like this one, it''s cosy. I love the colorful boots in the foreground, however I would have liked them to be in focus.', '2005-10-06 14:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764867, 239522, 24013, '<td valign="top">very cool.  love the division.  if i could i would rate this very high.</td>', 'very cool.  love the division.  if i could i would rate this very high.', '2005-10-06 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764870, 239483, 33679, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me glad I''m going to New England for a few days this month. I would really like to capture colors as beautiful as these.<br/> <br/>Nice composition also. You could have underexposed by 2/3 stop without hurting the detail in the trees, but also capturing much more sky detail.</td>', 'This picture makes me glad I''m going to New England for a few days this month. I would really like to capture colors as beautiful as these. Nice composition also. You could have underexposed by 2/3 stop without hurting the detail in the trees, but also capturing much more sky detail.', '2005-10-06 14:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764891, 239413, 40106, '<td valign="top">if that is your house you are one very very lucky person!!! the picture is great, the birds definitely add to the picture and the green trees against the blue sky are beautiful! There is a bit of a halo around the trees though, otherwise... stunning!</td>', 'if that is your house you are one very very lucky person!!! the picture is great, the birds definitely add to the picture and the green trees against the blue sky are beautiful! There is a bit of a halo around the trees though, otherwise... stunning!', '2005-10-06 14:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
