(1765143, 239335, 4477, '<td valign="top">Great cityscape...but it''s just a tad overexposed.  A shot later in the day, or earlier, would probably help.  I like it alot though!</td>', 'Great cityscape...but it''s just a tad overexposed.  A shot later in the day, or earlier, would probably help.  I like it alot though!', '2005-10-06 15:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
