(1765189, 239174, 30222, '<td valign="top">aw..that looks soo much like the clock i often heard ticking when i was a kid<br/>too bad this one stopped its ticking (at least thats what it looks like)<br/>a nice nostalgic deja vu for me<br/></td>', 'aw..that looks soo much like the clock i often heard ticking when i was a kidtoo bad this one stopped its ticking (at least thats what it looks like)a nice nostalgic deja vu for me', '2005-10-06 16:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765190, 238782, 13381, '<td valign="top">Lovely color, beautiful reflection... I like the composition, too, the way the pier guides your eye out to the geese in the water.  I''m a coastal girl, so this speaks to me quite a lot. The only critique I have is that personally, I''d rather see the top parts of the pier and the posts to be more silhouetted where the sun isn''t shining off of them.  In other words, I''d like it better if the almost-blacks were blacks.</td>', 'Lovely color, beautiful reflection... I like the composition, too, the way the pier guides your eye out to the geese in the water.  I''m a coastal girl, so this speaks to me quite a lot. The only critique I have is that personally, I''d rather see the top parts of the pier and the posts to be more silhouetted where the sun isn''t shining off of them.  In other words, I''d like it better if the almost-blacks were blacks.', '2005-10-06 16:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765230, 239199, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting foreground in this... not the same old view everybody shoots.  Kinda nice.  8</td>', 'Interesting foreground in this... not the same old view everybody shoots.  Kinda nice.  8', '2005-10-06 16:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
