(1768228, 237711, 36309, '<td valign="top">Very moody - superb</td>', 'Very moody - superb', '2005-10-07 17:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768231, 239201, 36309, '<td valign="top">This may have been more effective with a lower point of view to make the train stand out more from the background.  Would it have been possible to have chosen a different angle to avoid some of the background clutter?  Alteratively maybe a larger appeture to throw the background out of focus a little may have helped.</td>', 'This may have been more effective with a lower point of view to make the train stand out more from the background.  Would it have been possible to have chosen a different angle to avoid some of the background clutter?  Alteratively maybe a larger appeture to throw the background out of focus a little may have helped.', '2005-10-07 17:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768238, 239391, 36309, '<td valign="top">The sky looks a little artificial, to me at least.  If this is really how it looked I apologise as there obviously wouldn''t have been much you could have done about it - I guess it is a shame that there were no clouds to add a little detail and possibly drama.</td>', 'The sky looks a little artificial, to me at least.  If this is really how it looked I apologise as there obviously wouldn''t have been much you could have done about it - I guess it is a shame that there were no clouds to add a little detail and possibly drama.', '2005-10-07 17:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
