(1768621, 238465, 42198, '<td valign="top">Is that Andromeda? - Nice idea for the challenge. Although I didn''t score it very highly as I have seen better astrophotographs of Andromeda than this one; and that''s all I have to compare it to. But I do know how difficult these shots are to get right - and it is a good effort. I''d like to hear what setup/processing you used for this.</td>', 'Is that Andromeda? - Nice idea for the challenge. Although I didn''t score it very highly as I have seen better astrophotographs of Andromeda than this one; and that''s all I have to compare it to. But I do know how difficult these shots are to get right - and it is a good effort. I''d like to hear what setup/processing you used for this.', '2005-10-07 20:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
