(1768692, 238033, 42198, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative composition - it works really well. Great colours and light.</td>', 'Very imaginative composition - it works really well. Great colours and light.', '2005-10-07 20:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768695, 239436, 42198, '<td valign="top">Colours look muted.</td>', 'Colours look muted.', '2005-10-07 20:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768700, 237922, 42198, '<td valign="top">If only the dog and the arm were out of the shot....</td>', 'If only the dog and the arm were out of the shot....', '2005-10-07 20:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768703, 238921, 42198, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Very well composed.</td>', 'Beautiful. Very well composed.', '2005-10-07 20:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768707, 238710, 42198, '<td valign="top">Focus problems. Pity, as the colours look interesting.</td>', 'Focus problems. Pity, as the colours look interesting.', '2005-10-07 20:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768713, 239131, 42198, '<td valign="top">Looks oversharpened. Too much blue/purple tint. Also, there are a lot of elements in this to distract the eye. The sign, the traffic light, the buildings, the ''university'' sign, and the ''gp'' at top left all distract. What''s the subject?</td>', 'Looks oversharpened. Too much blue/purple tint. Also, there are a lot of elements in this to distract the eye. The sign, the traffic light, the buildings, the ''university'' sign, and the ''gp'' at top left all distract. What''s the subject?', '2005-10-07 20:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768717, 239410, 42198, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge perfectly. Composition is spot-on.</td>', 'Fits the challenge perfectly. Composition is spot-on.', '2005-10-07 20:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768810, 239517, 45590, '<td valign="top">Definitely the prairies! Captures it so well. 8</td>', 'Definitely the prairies! Captures it so well. 8', '2005-10-07 21:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768830, 239522, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The most intellectually and artistically adventurous image in the challenge.  It''s a terrific fusion of the abstract (mountain, beach and ocean) with the only too real-world &amp; pedestrian (the feet).    I applaud the choice of suitable footwear, and the alignment of the feet with the mountainsides.  And to make it even more rewarding for the viewer, you''ve added the intrigue and interest of the shadow shapes.  No option for me here; this is a 10!</td>', 'Love this.  The most intellectually and artistically adventurous image in the challenge.  It''s a terrific fusion of the abstract (mountain, beach and ocean) with the only too real-world & pedestrian (the feet).    I applaud the choice of suitable footwear, and the alignment of the feet with the mountainsides.  And to make it even more rewarding for the viewer, you''ve added the intrigue and interest of the shadow shapes.  No option for me here; this is a 10!', '2005-10-07 21:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768831, 239236, 38032, '<td valign="top">this definitely makes me want to know more.  very nice. 7</td>', 'this definitely makes me want to know more.  very nice. 7', '2005-10-07 21:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768843, 238657, 23430, '<td valign="top">Fun idea and well executed. Great to see some originality.</td>', 'Fun idea and well executed. Great to see some originality.', '2005-10-07 22:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768850, 237186, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good idea deliberately putting the house out of focus. Well done.</td>', 'Good idea deliberately putting the house out of focus. Well done.', '2005-10-07 22:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768859, 239355, 42740, '<td valign="top">Immigrant Song .... cool picture!</td>', 'Immigrant Song .... cool picture!', '2005-10-07 22:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768864, 239461, 23430, '<td valign="top">I like the panarama format and the scene though I think it would add more interest if there was a subject in the shot to focus on.</td>', 'I like the panarama format and the scene though I think it would add more interest if there was a subject in the shot to focus on.', '2005-10-07 22:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768874, 237638, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific apocalyptic vision.  Especially love the HIGH VOLTAGE sign in combination with the overhead wires ... I can hear AC/DC quite clearly when I look at this image!  The trio of lighted windows suggests some of the neighbours have shut themselves in, perhaps hoping to ride out the coming ultimate event.  Anyway, it''s great idea, and is composed, lighted and processed brilliantly.  10.</td>', 'Terrific apocalyptic vision.  Especially love the HIGH VOLTAGE sign in combination with the overhead wires ... I can hear AC/DC quite clearly when I look at this image!  The trio of lighted windows suggests some of the neighbours have shut themselves in, perhaps hoping to ride out the coming ultimate event.  Anyway, it''s great idea, and is composed, lighted and processed brilliantly.  10.', '2005-10-07 22:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768875, 239302, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Balanced foregroung and background. I like it.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Balanced foregroung and background. I like it.', '2005-10-07 22:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768894, 237479, 42740, '<td valign="top">A little too dark</td>', 'A little too dark', '2005-10-07 22:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768900, 238979, 25355, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped of the building on the left and made the windmill less central.<br/> <br/>... but then, what do I know? <br/> <br/>You took this shot at the right time of day - nice lighting.</td>', 'I would have cropped of the building on the left and made the windmill less central. ... but then, what do I know?  You took this shot at the right time of day - nice lighting.', '2005-10-07 22:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768904, 239410, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully harmonious composition; the arrangement of the various elements establishes an odd combination of serenity and tension.  The fact that the person''s attention is directed outside the frame, in the same direction as the leading lines of the partly visible door bracing, seems to suggest wariness or at least watchfulness.  Whereas the person''s back leaned against the door frame implies security.  These two almost contradictory concepts are elegantly combined in your photograph.  Interesting and absorbing.  9.</td>', 'This is a beautifully harmonious composition; the arrangement of the various elements establishes an odd combination of serenity and tension.  The fact that the person''s attention is directed outside the frame, in the same direction as the leading lines of the partly visible door bracing, seems to suggest wariness or at least watchfulness.  Whereas the person''s back leaned against the door frame implies security.  These two almost contradictory concepts are elegantly combined in your photograph.  Interesting and absorbing.  9.', '2005-10-07 22:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768905, 239234, 19961, '<td valign="top">Maybe it would have been more harmonic had you removed the white chair?</td>', 'Maybe it would have been more harmonic had you removed the white chair?', '2005-10-07 22:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768916, 237879, 25355, '<td valign="top">Dodging/burning a tad overdone? Especially in the top corners.</td>', 'Dodging/burning a tad overdone? Especially in the top corners.', '2005-10-07 22:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768927, 239236, 25355, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if this is in Porchugal. This is the kind of shot you''d find in those arty postcards you get in Mediterranean countries.</td>', 'I''m wondering if this is in Porchugal. This is the kind of shot you''d find in those arty postcards you get in Mediterranean countries.', '2005-10-07 22:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768937, 239136, 25355, '<td valign="top">..and the 200th anniversary is coming soon.</td>', '..and the 200th anniversary is coming soon.', '2005-10-07 22:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768941, 238420, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed rich B&amp;W ... actually I think it''s a duotone?  The composition is simple yet stylish, and the combination of shadows &amp; highlights is almost theatrical (I mean that as a compliment).  Love the details just visible in the stall on the right; the horse and the light on the bars above the door.  The light source is nicely incorporated without overpowering the shot, and the multiple shadows in the lower right foreground are fascinating.  Nice image.  9.</td>', 'Beautifully executed rich B&W ... actually I think it''s a duotone?  The composition is simple yet stylish, and the combination of shadows & highlights is almost theatrical (I mean that as a compliment).  Love the details just visible in the stall on the right; the horse and the light on the bars above the door.  The light source is nicely incorporated without overpowering the shot, and the multiple shadows in the lower right foreground are fascinating.  Nice image.  9.', '2005-10-07 22:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768946, 239384, 25355, '<td valign="top">I understand that there are a lot of covered bridges in Madison County. This must be one of the least attractive ones ;-)</td>', 'I understand that there are a lot of covered bridges in Madison County. This must be one of the least attractive ones ;-)', '2005-10-07 22:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
