(1769014, 237853, 42638, '<td valign="top">Looks very nice, quiet and peaceful. Makes me want to take a walk. Love it</td>', 'Looks very nice, quiet and peaceful. Makes me want to take a walk. Love it', '2005-10-07 22:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769015, 238498, 30364, '<td valign="top">This has got some odd and unsettling aspects to it ... there''s one or two strange perspective shifts in there that result in an image that insists on some serious attention and thought from the viewer.  It''s hard to know exactly how all the elements fit together, or if indeed they DO fit together.  The impression created is of disjointedness and opression which, given your title, is likely exactly the impact you were intending.  It''s a very fine and challenging image, and well worth a few minutes'' analysis.  Hope it gets it!  9.</td>', 'This has got some odd and unsettling aspects to it ... there''s one or two strange perspective shifts in there that result in an image that insists on some serious attention and thought from the viewer.  It''s hard to know exactly how all the elements fit together, or if indeed they DO fit together.  The impression created is of disjointedness and opression which, given your title, is likely exactly the impact you were intending.  It''s a very fine and challenging image, and well worth a few minutes'' analysis.  Hope it gets it!  9.', '2005-10-07 22:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
