(1769039, 238056, 30364, '<td valign="top">This slightly neglected looking corner actually has great charm.  The impression created by your photograph is that perhaps it''s not really neglect at all ... perhaps it''s actually a case of contentment and satisfaction with the way things are ...  and a desire to leave well enough alone.  It''s an appealing thought and an appealing image.  8.</td>', 'This slightly neglected looking corner actually has great charm.  The impression created by your photograph is that perhaps it''s not really neglect at all ... perhaps it''s actually a case of contentment and satisfaction with the way things are ...  and a desire to leave well enough alone.  It''s an appealing thought and an appealing image.  8.', '2005-10-07 22:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769042, 238890, 42567, '<td valign="top">great job..!</td>', 'great job..!', '2005-10-07 22:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
