(1769055, 239228, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the rows ... it looks like plastic covering over strawberries, or is it some kind of grass silage?  Whatever, the effect is startling in your image, and your composition is most effective.  I very much like the stark, minimalist look of it, and the subdued but elegant colours.  Hope you''ll explain just what it is!  8.</td>', 'I don''t understand the rows ... it looks like plastic covering over strawberries, or is it some kind of grass silage?  Whatever, the effect is startling in your image, and your composition is most effective.  I very much like the stark, minimalist look of it, and the subdued but elegant colours.  Hope you''ll explain just what it is!  8.', '2005-10-07 22:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
