(1769098, 239368, 30364, '<td valign="top">A clever image.  The person''s gaze directed toward the reflected sign and the alien-looking light source creates a slightly unworldly, surrealist effect which is further heightened by the bizarre "X" cap he/she is wearing.  I like it because it''s original and because it challenges the viewer to participate  rather than just spectate.  Alas, the spectators will vote it down!  8.</td>', 'A clever image.  The person''s gaze directed toward the reflected sign and the alien-looking light source creates a slightly unworldly, surrealist effect which is further heightened by the bizarre "X" cap he/she is wearing.  I like it because it''s original and because it challenges the viewer to participate  rather than just spectate.  Alas, the spectators will vote it down!  8.', '2005-10-07 23:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769099, 236666, 42567, '<td valign="top">awesome..!! 10</td>', 'awesome..!! 10', '2005-10-07 23:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
