(1770203, 237985, 19474, '<td valign="top">What day was this, I spent all Saturday afternoon and drove right around the mountain starting at Waiouru then out through Ohakune, National park, turangi and back along the desert Road ending up on the Tukino Ski field access road at sunset (bloody cold) I was at the complete wrong angle for the sunset as I had no idea where it would go down, so none of my shots work as well as this so I entered a completly different one - 7</td>', 'What day was this, I spent all Saturday afternoon and drove right around the mountain starting at Waiouru then out through Ohakune, National park, turangi and back along the desert Road ending up on the Tukino Ski field access road at sunset (bloody cold) I was at the complete wrong angle for the sunset as I had no idea where it would go down, so none of my shots work as well as this so I entered a completly different one - 7', '2005-10-08 15:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
