(1771041, 237762, 4767, '<td valign="top">This is a fine  example of a decent photo with an overly-heavy frame.  The immage is massive, the frame doesn''t look as though it belonged in there.</td>', 'This is a fine  example of a decent photo with an overly-heavy frame.  The immage is massive, the frame doesn''t look as though it belonged in there.', '2005-10-09 00:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
