(1771067, 239550, 4767, '<td valign="top">YESSS!!!   10</td>', 'YESSS!!!   10', '2005-10-09 01:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771080, 239275, 14212, '<td valign="top">Where do you live? lucky you!  10</td>', 'Where do you live? lucky you!  10', '2005-10-09 01:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771107, 239234, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great balance in this shot..but the LOOK is being killed by the plastic chair in the foreground..it is dominating my eye.  The rest of the shot works..nice job.</td>', 'Great balance in this shot..but the LOOK is being killed by the plastic chair in the foreground..it is dominating my eye.  The rest of the shot works..nice job.', '2005-10-09 01:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771156, 237714, 25433, '<td valign="top">This is pretty spectacular. I am curious about how much editting took place. Lovely image, not sure if I''d be standing there with an umbrella if lightning was in the air!</td>', 'This is pretty spectacular. I am curious about how much editting took place. Lovely image, not sure if I''d be standing there with an umbrella if lightning was in the air!', '2005-10-09 01:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771180, 238132, 14805, '<td valign="top">on the right track here. you should use a polarizing filter witht this image, and your horizon is too centered. If it were more to the top or bottom it would have been a much more dynamic shot. You can still fix this in the crop. Also, more sat and a little bit of curves would have made this a perfect image.</td>', 'on the right track here. you should use a polarizing filter witht this image, and your horizon is too centered. If it were more to the top or bottom it would have been a much more dynamic shot. You can still fix this in the crop. Also, more sat and a little bit of curves would have made this a perfect image.', '2005-10-09 02:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771184, 237687, 14805, '<td valign="top">hmmm... I''m sure you have gotten lots of complaints about the processing on this. It is not to my taste, but I do think it has it''s place. It does have  a good dirty feel to it. perhaps some grain would have helped make it better? I dont know. The treatment makes it look dirty, but the particular part of the city you used is very clean.6</td>', 'hmmm... I''m sure you have gotten lots of complaints about the processing on this. It is not to my taste, but I do think it has it''s place. It does have  a good dirty feel to it. perhaps some grain would have helped make it better? I dont know. The treatment makes it look dirty, but the particular part of the city you used is very clean.6', '2005-10-09 02:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
