(1772029, 238591, 42984, '<td valign="top">the lighting an dbalance is superb on the boy, if *his* point of interest is the beaker then I feel that needs to be in focus also.  My original perception was that he is looking at something else, not that.</td>', 'the lighting an dbalance is superb on the boy, if *his* point of interest is the beaker then I feel that needs to be in focus also.  My original perception was that he is looking at something else, not that.', '2005-10-09 15:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772032, 239369, 22781, '<td valign="top">Exceptional!</td>', 'Exceptional!', '2005-10-09 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772039, 239199, 22781, '<td valign="top">Beutifull, looks like a postcard!</td>', 'Beutifull, looks like a postcard!', '2005-10-09 16:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772041, 239454, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good cityscape but it lacks any real punch I think.  I guess its the lidday light that tends to flatten everything it touches</td>', 'Good cityscape but it lacks any real punch I think.  I guess its the lidday light that tends to flatten everything it touches', '2005-10-09 16:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772047, 239441, 42984, '<td valign="top">Love the scultpture and the photo</td>', 'Love the scultpture and the photo', '2005-10-09 16:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772052, 238258, 42984, '<td valign="top">This has a really nice feel to it.  Early morning sun is evident from th shadows, quiet is evident from no traffic, lighting is just right.  I can''t believe that you spoilt all of that by not rotating the image against a grid before submitting it  Two whole points lost because of that I''m afraid, it''s worth more</td>', 'This has a really nice feel to it.  Early morning sun is evident from th shadows, quiet is evident from no traffic, lighting is just right.  I can''t believe that you spoilt all of that by not rotating the image against a grid before submitting it  Two whole points lost because of that I''m afraid, it''s worth more', '2005-10-09 16:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772054, 238765, 42984, '<td valign="top">I like the old/new concept a lot but somehow this image doesn''t excite, it''s just "nice"</td>', 'I like the old/new concept a lot but somehow this image doesn''t excite, it''s just "nice"', '2005-10-09 16:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772061, 239172, 42984, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for snow!  I''m more of a sucker fro good composition.ight and emotive power in a shot.  You are lucky to have such great landscapes for your canvas, but you have the skills to also find the nest in them.  The dark angry sky backdropping the bright mountain is very cool</td>', 'I''m a sucker for snow!  I''m more of a sucker fro good composition.ight and emotive power in a shot.  You are lucky to have such great landscapes for your canvas, but you have the skills to also find the nest in them.  The dark angry sky backdropping the bright mountain is very cool', '2005-10-09 16:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772064, 239499, 42984, '<td valign="top">Am a great fan of retro too</td>', 'Am a great fan of retro too', '2005-10-09 16:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772065, 236991, 42984, '<td valign="top">Top nightscape, good composition and spot on long exposure work</td>', 'Top nightscape, good composition and spot on long exposure work', '2005-10-09 16:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772067, 238805, 42984, '<td valign="top">Spot on for the challenge</td>', 'Spot on for the challenge', '2005-10-09 16:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772071, 239272, 42984, '<td valign="top">The countryside is so attractive.  I''m a pilot too, so love the aerial shots and the way you get such a different perspective on things. I just think this shot is a bit ordinary</td>', 'The countryside is so attractive.  I''m a pilot too, so love the aerial shots and the way you get such a different perspective on things. I just think this shot is a bit ordinary', '2005-10-09 16:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772072, 237588, 42984, '<td valign="top">Yup - this works.  Creativity and simplicity work beautifully.</td>', 'Yup - this works.  Creativity and simplicity work beautifully.', '2005-10-09 16:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772075, 237958, 42984, '<td valign="top">Ahh, a different and very interesting look at one of the worlds most photographed structures.  The lighting, balance and thoughtfulness of this image has commercial illustrative  possibilities</td>', 'Ahh, a different and very interesting look at one of the worlds most photographed structures.  The lighting, balance and thoughtfulness of this image has commercial illustrative  possibilities', '2005-10-09 16:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772076, 239345, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks cold! Good job with the snow and capturing what looks like fast-moving clouds -- adds a god sense of dynamicism to what could be a flat scene.</td>', 'Looks cold! Good job with the snow and capturing what looks like fast-moving clouds -- adds a god sense of dynamicism to what could be a flat scene.', '2005-10-09 16:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772077, 238240, 42984, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  The painting quality of this is compelling as is the composition</td>', 'Excellent.  The painting quality of this is compelling as is the composition', '2005-10-09 16:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772080, 238650, 42984, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition, I would just have liked to see a little more colour work done as it really doe look a little flat and unintereesting</td>', 'Perfect composition, I would just have liked to see a little more colour work done as it really doe look a little flat and unintereesting', '2005-10-09 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772081, 237699, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like that sign : )</td>', 'I like that sign : )', '2005-10-09 16:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772083, 238996, 42984, '<td valign="top">Try working on your compositions</td>', 'Try working on your compositions', '2005-10-09 16:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772085, 238774, 42984, '<td valign="top">Thas a stunning image.  So simple which is where it gets its power from.  Like the way the backdrop just halos away ever so subtly.  Composition almost perfect.</td>', 'Thas a stunning image.  So simple which is where it gets its power from.  Like the way the backdrop just halos away ever so subtly.  Composition almost perfect.', '2005-10-09 16:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772086, 239201, 42984, '<td valign="top">Well it''s not hard to guess whose this is :)</td>', 'Well it''s not hard to guess whose this is :)', '2005-10-09 16:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772090, 236666, 1031, '<td valign="top">Somehow I''ve missed that when in Oregon -- I''ll have to check it out.<br/> <br/>If you want the border that heavy, I think it would look better with the outer part of the photo faded back, since it seems to be intended to be less important. If I were going to frame this at all, I think I''d rather fade the outside and omit the line, or use one just a couple of pixelswide  in white (or maybe even black).</td>', 'Somehow I''ve missed that when in Oregon -- I''ll have to check it out. If you want the border that heavy, I think it would look better with the outer part of the photo faded back, since it seems to be intended to be less important. If I were going to frame this at all, I think I''d rather fade the outside and omit the line, or use one just a couple of pixelswide  in white (or maybe even black).', '2005-10-09 16:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772092, 238717, 42984, '<td valign="top">This si a good use of the architectural light and the subject light.  I''s not easy to get the good balance that you have.  The little blocky thing bottom left is annoying but appreciate that you have no control over that and have not taken it into account in vote.</td>', 'This si a good use of the architectural light and the subject light.  I''s not easy to get the good balance that you have.  The little blocky thing bottom left is annoying but appreciate that you have no control over that and have not taken it into account in vote.', '2005-10-09 16:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
