(1772722, 239477, 19474, '<td valign="top">optus cable tv box? could it be Australia<br/>I like how the light shows up and looks like a half moon, its a pitty that you couldn''t get some light to show in the other ones to complete the picture<br/>but still a good 7</td>', 'optus cable tv box? could it be AustraliaI like how the light shows up and looks like a half moon, its a pitty that you couldn''t get some light to show in the other ones to complete the picturebut still a good 7', '2005-10-09 23:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772732, 238516, 19474, '<td valign="top">a little bit too red for my taste... maybe play with the color balance a little<br/>a nice shot ~ 6</td>', 'a little bit too red for my taste... maybe play with the color balance a littlea nice shot ~ 6', '2005-10-09 23:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772737, 238966, 19474, '<td valign="top">a little too much tree for me..... possibly dropping the camera down 1 foot to shoot would have balanced the shot more<br/>~ 6</td>', 'a little too much tree for me..... possibly dropping the camera down 1 foot to shoot would have balanced the shot more~ 6', '2005-10-09 23:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772740, 238782, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice complementary colors. The leading line is very effective and the roundness of the tires is an unexpected curve at the end of the straight dock.  I''d like to see a figure or dog, or something sitting or standing on the dock for just a little height and added punch.</td>', 'Nice complementary colors. The leading line is very effective and the roundness of the tires is an unexpected curve at the end of the straight dock.  I''d like to see a figure or dog, or something sitting or standing on the dock for just a little height and added punch.', '2005-10-09 23:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772743, 238640, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot.  I like the placement of the monument and the figures.  The dark lawn might be a tad brighter by removing the black in the selective color adjustment (green). Just a thought.</td>', 'Very pretty shot.  I like the placement of the monument and the figures.  The dark lawn might be a tad brighter by removing the black in the selective color adjustment (green). Just a thought.', '2005-10-09 23:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772755, 239345, 32754, '<td valign="top">lovely interesting image</td>', 'lovely interesting image', '2005-10-09 23:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772758, 239420, 19474, '<td valign="top">I like the chair, lighting, b&amp;w and the idea<br/>but the shots not looking balanced to me... I think turning the chair so the left arm (as we look at it) was to the front might fix it for me ~ 6</td>', 'I like the chair, lighting, b&w and the ideabut the shots not looking balanced to me... I think turning the chair so the left arm (as we look at it) was to the front might fix it for me ~ 6', '2005-10-09 23:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772761, 239418, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot; but I think the lighting and composition sort of weaken it...maybe closer with a little more light; feel free to ignore my idea if this was what you wanted in the image.</td>', 'I like this idea a lot; but I think the lighting and composition sort of weaken it...maybe closer with a little more light; feel free to ignore my idea if this was what you wanted in the image.', '2005-10-09 23:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772763, 239127, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better had you kept it in black and white throughout, or possibly did a single sat of his jeans, being one color, instead of the duality of the contrasting blue and yellow. It seems too distracting with the color as it is. The lighting seems a bit overexposed on the top of his head. Maybe if he were in the shadowy area instead of bright light, it might have worked a bit better, especially being a light blonde.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better had you kept it in black and white throughout, or possibly did a single sat of his jeans, being one color, instead of the duality of the contrasting blue and yellow. It seems too distracting with the color as it is. The lighting seems a bit overexposed on the top of his head. Maybe if he were in the shadowy area instead of bright light, it might have worked a bit better, especially being a light blonde.', '2005-10-09 23:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772764, 239236, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity here, and even the colors, though I suspect it might work in b/w, too. It seems to lack just a bit of clarity. Try sharpening and perhaps adding some contrast. Super eye and excellent composition here. All in all, nice work! 8</td>', 'I like the simplicity here, and even the colors, though I suspect it might work in b/w, too. It seems to lack just a bit of clarity. Try sharpening and perhaps adding some contrast. Super eye and excellent composition here. All in all, nice work! 8', '2005-10-09 23:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772766, 237650, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely, sweeping view! I love the geometry of colors, and the amount of space devoted to sky and sea. 8</td>', 'This is a lovely, sweeping view! I love the geometry of colors, and the amount of space devoted to sky and sea. 8', '2005-10-09 23:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772767, 237958, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  It makes you look at it to figure it out.  The use of negative space is good.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  It makes you look at it to figure it out.  The use of negative space is good.', '2005-10-09 23:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772768, 238803, 32754, '<td valign="top">If this is a pond in your yard, it''s absolutely stunning...it is a corner of heaven and well photographed...love the egret and reflections.</td>', 'If this is a pond in your yard, it''s absolutely stunning...it is a corner of heaven and well photographed...love the egret and reflections.', '2005-10-09 23:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772770, 239324, 32754, '<td valign="top">I had a spot at the beach like this when I was a kid...secluded and beautiful...nice image.</td>', 'I had a spot at the beach like this when I was a kid...secluded and beautiful...nice image.', '2005-10-09 23:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772771, 239502, 6870, '<td valign="top">Looks lovely. Perhaps I''ll come and visit you soon! Nice composition here, and I like the gentle diagonal of the line of houses. 8</td>', 'Looks lovely. Perhaps I''ll come and visit you soon! Nice composition here, and I like the gentle diagonal of the line of houses. 8', '2005-10-09 23:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
