(1773032, 239199, 19982, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jhonan:</b></div><hr/><i> The tables/chairs in the foreground are a bit distracting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just one quick comment:  I''ve taken a million pictures of the temple, from all different angles.  This one was purposely composed with the tables and chairs in the image to give it more of a "warm and inviting" feeling.  Many many people spend their lunch time out at these tables in this beautiful surrounding.  My office is in the building that is just to the right of these chairs and that is why I call this my corner of the world.  :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by jhonan: The tables/chairs in the foreground are a bit distracting.   Just one quick comment:  I''ve taken a million pictures of the temple, from all different angles.  This one was purposely composed with the tables and chairs in the image to give it more of a "warm and inviting" feeling.  Many many people spend their lunch time out at these tables in this beautiful surrounding.  My office is in the building that is just to the right of these chairs and that is why I call this my corner of the world.  :-)', '2005-10-10 01:11:35.000000', NULL, 0),
