(1773812, 237714, 10413, '<td valign="top">I thought this would have done better also. An awesome shot but after reading how you did it, it made it even better. Congrats on a nice finish anyway.</td>', 'I thought this would have done better also. An awesome shot but after reading how you did it, it made it even better. Congrats on a nice finish anyway.', '2005-10-10 10:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
