(1773830, 239199, 10413, '<td valign="top">This was a 9 for me and expected it to place higher.  It was unique to all the sunsets and landscapes.</td>', 'This was a 9 for me and expected it to place higher.  It was unique to all the sunsets and landscapes.', '2005-10-10 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1773835, 237958, 10985, '<td valign="top">I can only agree with Ray, here. Although, unlike him, I do like this version of la Tour Eiffel.<br/> <br/>(Je ne peux qu''être d''accord avec Ray. Mais contrairement à lui, j''aime bien cette version de la Tour Eiffel.)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-10 10:39:22.</i></td>', 'I can only agree with Ray, here. Although, unlike him, I do like this version of la Tour Eiffel. (Je ne peux qu''être d''accord avec Ray. Mais contrairement à lui, j''aime bien cette version de la Tour Eiffel.)', '2005-10-10 10:34:56.000000', '2005-10-10 11:39:22.000000', 0),
(1773836, 239403, 27786, '<td valign="top">Congratulation with the top five finish! Gurrý hefur rétt fyrir sér, þetta klikkar ekki! ;-)</td>', 'Congratulation with the top five finish! Gurrý hefur rétt fyrir sér, þetta klikkar ekki! ;-)', '2005-10-10 10:35:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1773838, 239199, 42198, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dwterry:</b></div><hr/><i>Many many people spend their lunch time out at these tables in this beautiful surrounding.  My office is in the building that is just to the right of these chairs and that is why I call this my corner of the world.  :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Ahhh.... okay. Thanks for the explanation.<br/> <br/>When I first saw the shot with the title referring to the temple. I assumed the temple was the main subject. I couldn''t understand why the tables/chairs were included in the composition. Hence my comment.<br/> <br/>Nice view from your office though - I''m jealous!</td>', 'Originally posted by dwterry:Many many people spend their lunch time out at these tables in this beautiful surrounding.  My office is in the building that is just to the right of these chairs and that is why I call this my corner of the world.  :-)  Ahhh.... okay. Thanks for the explanation. When I first saw the shot with the title referring to the temple. I assumed the temple was the main subject. I couldn''t understand why the tables/chairs were included in the composition. Hence my comment. Nice view from your office though - I''m jealous!', '2005-10-10 10:36:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1773839, 237879, 34659, '<td valign="top">Congrats Judy on your PB!  Great shot &amp; great finish!  Love this one!  Good job!!!</td>', 'Congrats Judy on your PB!  Great shot & great finish!  Love this one!  Good job!!!', '2005-10-10 10:37:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1773843, 239131, 39664, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all that commented.  <br/> <br/>I really wasn''t going for just another skyline of Atlanta.  If I were, I would have gone to a better spot for a better view of the Atlanta skyline.  My intent, obviously not understood, was to show a cross-section of what makes Atlanta the very diverse Atlanta.  If MLK crossed Peachtree St (any of the 20 or so of them) I may would have taken a photo of that.  <br/> <br/>Looking back, I was at "The Ted" Braves Stadium (they lost last night to Houston....boo!) I probably would have done better if I shot a photo of The Ted.  I think more people would have "gotten" that!<br/> <br/>This is how we grow!  :-)</td>', 'Thank you to all that commented.   I really wasn''t going for just another skyline of Atlanta.  If I were, I would have gone to a better spot for a better view of the Atlanta skyline.  My intent, obviously not understood, was to show a cross-section of what makes Atlanta the very diverse Atlanta.  If MLK crossed Peachtree St (any of the 20 or so of them) I may would have taken a photo of that.   Looking back, I was at "The Ted" Braves Stadium (they lost last night to Houston....boo!) I probably would have done better if I shot a photo of The Ted.  I think more people would have "gotten" that! This is how we grow!  :-)', '2005-10-10 10:40:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1773855, 239294, 27786, '<td valign="top">I can''t put in words how suprised I''m that this picture turned out to be my personal best! It was taken on a hike with a local rescue team (Björgunarsveit) and since I didn''t want to carry the 300d with me, I grapped my mom''s little p&amp;s camera. This clearly shows, that it isn''t just the equipment! ;-)<br/> <br/>And thanks for the congratulations guys, it''s really inspiring to see that there are someone that watches you! :)</td>', 'I can''t put in words how suprised I''m that this picture turned out to be my personal best! It was taken on a hike with a local rescue team (Björgunarsveit) and since I didn''t want to carry the 300d with me, I grapped my mom''s little p&s camera. This clearly shows, that it isn''t just the equipment! ;-) And thanks for the congratulations guys, it''s really inspiring to see that there are someone that watches you! :)', '2005-10-10 10:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1773856, 239303, 22872, '<td valign="top">I tell ya....I Have got to get over there and visit!  I saw this and wondered if it might be yours.  I love this photo!! <br/> <br/></td>', 'I tell ya....I Have got to get over there and visit!  I saw this and wondered if it might be yours.  I love this photo!!  ', '2005-10-10 10:45:03.000000', NULL, 0),
