(1773870, 239529, 22872, '<td valign="top">Yeah...we have a nasty papermill here in Panama City too :/  Very yucky smell and the stuff that is left on my car is gross too....<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-10 09:56:57.</i></td>', 'Yeah...we have a nasty papermill here in Panama City too :/  Very yucky smell and the stuff that is left on my car is gross too.... ', '2005-10-10 10:56:18.000000', '2005-10-10 10:56:57.000000', 0),
