(1773907, 238588, 3569, '<td valign="top">Mt. Blanca is in the Sange de Cristo Range in Huerfano and Costilla Counties, In Colorado.  The shot was from the south, off Colo. Hwy. 160.  Not far from DPCer Sammie''s home.  I was incorrect in height its only 14,345 ft., but is the 5th highest in Colorado. The part you see is the very top of the volcano part of the mountain.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-10 13:58:01.</i></td>', 'Mt. Blanca is in the Sange de Cristo Range in Huerfano and Costilla Counties, In Colorado.  The shot was from the south, off Colo. Hwy. 160.  Not far from DPCer Sammie''s home.  I was incorrect in height its only 14,345 ft., but is the 5th highest in Colorado. The part you see is the very top of the volcano part of the mountain.', '2005-10-10 11:29:48.000000', '2005-10-10 14:58:01.000000', 0),
(1773929, 237879, 20941, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a personal best and a Beautiful shot!!</td>', 'Congratulations on a personal best and a Beautiful shot!!', '2005-10-10 11:46:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1773944, 237879, 8367, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and treatment...I did a doubletake...this could be our horse in our back pasture! :D</td>', 'Beautiful shot and treatment...I did a doubletake...this could be our horse in our back pasture! :D', '2005-10-10 11:55:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1774029, 238753, 2333, '<td valign="top">Hey Eric, congrats! This was definitely one of my top picks in this challenge. Well deserved ribbon. WTG!</td>', 'Hey Eric, congrats! This was definitely one of my top picks in this challenge. Well deserved ribbon. WTG!', '2005-10-10 12:47:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1774037, 238797, 30861, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot Peter! I had this pegged for blue when I saw it. You might ocnsider leveling the horizon on this one now to make it even "purer".</td>', 'Really nice shot Peter! I had this pegged for blue when I saw it. You might ocnsider leveling the horizon on this one now to make it even "purer".', '2005-10-10 12:53:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1774040, 238753, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s bright! Congratulations on a startling capture of pure color.</td>', 'Wow that''s bright! Congratulations on a startling capture of pure color.', '2005-10-10 12:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1774049, 238753, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thehitter:</b></div><hr/><i> that is pretty but since when does the sun rise over the ocean (west) in malibu? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The entire coastline of California runs roughly east/west from Santa Monica to Port Hueneme. There are plenty of small headlands in that stretch where you can actually look east at the water.</td>', 'Originally posted by thehitter: that is pretty but since when does the sun rise over the ocean (west) in malibu?   The entire coastline of California runs roughly east/west from Santa Monica to Port Hueneme. There are plenty of small headlands in that stretch where you can actually look east at the water.', '2005-10-10 12:58:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1774051, 239305, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful B/W conversion. Care to share how you made it? And congrats on a well-deserved ribbon!</td>', 'This is a beautiful B/W conversion. Care to share how you made it? And congrats on a well-deserved ribbon!', '2005-10-10 12:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1774056, 239403, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautiful B/W conversion, moody post-processing. "Our" 10-22mm lens is rapidly rising to the top as the landscape lens of choice, LOL. I take it this is a modern sculpture of the bare bones of a Viking longship? More information would be wonderful.</td>', 'Beautiful B/W conversion, moody post-processing. "Our" 10-22mm lens is rapidly rising to the top as the landscape lens of choice, LOL. I take it this is a modern sculpture of the bare bones of a Viking longship? More information would be wonderful.', '2005-10-10 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1774061, 239438, 15711, '<td valign="top">Congrats.  Kansas, Texas, Oklahoma - we all have those windmills.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Congrats.  Kansas, Texas, Oklahoma - we all have those windmills.  Nicely done.', '2005-10-10 13:03:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1774063, 239302, 30861, '<td valign="top">Really nice finish! Great use of foreground perspective.</td>', 'Really nice finish! Great use of foreground perspective.', '2005-10-10 13:03:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1774068, 236666, 30861, '<td valign="top">Throw me in the group that goes "pee-yew!" at the heavy inline border on an otherwise truly outstanding image.</td>', 'Throw me in the group that goes "pee-yew!" at the heavy inline border on an otherwise truly outstanding image.', '2005-10-10 13:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1774079, 238240, 30861, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this image. It''s so rewarding to examine closely, there''s so much in it. I wonder, did you crop at the top? I feel like you may have gone a hair too far, if so... I feel it would be stronger if the rooflines right and elgt weren''t quite so close to the edge of the frame.</td>', 'I absolutely love this image. It''s so rewarding to examine closely, there''s so much in it. I wonder, did you crop at the top? I feel like you may have gone a hair too far, if so... I feel it would be stronger if the rooflines right and elgt weren''t quite so close to the edge of the frame.', '2005-10-10 13:07:21.000000', NULL, 0),
