(1774626, 238753, 31637, '<td valign="top">I really was surprised this finished second..Don''t take me the wrong way , but this appeared to be heavily edited. I originally thought your sun was the way it would appear with the naked eye, but I could tell you removed the effect of its radience with red matching the sky. Kudos to you for doing that. Editing itself is an artform, separate from photography. I think this composition is excellent. I did give you a 6 originally and if the color wasn''t so caked up and rich, I might of gave it an 8. Congratulations !</td>', 'I really was surprised this finished second..Don''t take me the wrong way , but this appeared to be heavily edited. I originally thought your sun was the way it would appear with the naked eye, but I could tell you removed the effect of its radience with red matching the sky. Kudos to you for doing that. Editing itself is an artform, separate from photography. I think this composition is excellent. I did give you a 6 originally and if the color wasn''t so caked up and rich, I might of gave it an 8. Congratulations !', '2005-10-10 17:15:32.000000', NULL, 0),
