(1775950, 238730, 10794, '<td valign="top">you have taken a giant leap forward in your image creation/manifestation.<br/> <br/>not only is this image powerfully symbolic... but also innately powerful.<br/> <br/>what is even more important is that it contains within it the key to unlocking that power.<br/> <br/>very nice job.<br/> <br/>i don''t think i have done better than this.  conveying an old practice and yet in a very incocuous guise.<br/> <br/>try and establish the parameters of creativity which led to the creation of this image.  if you can find that comfort zone again... anything is truely possible... beyond the scope of these words to convey it.</td>', 'you have taken a giant leap forward in your image creation/manifestation. not only is this image powerfully symbolic... but also innately powerful. what is even more important is that it contains within it the key to unlocking that power. very nice job. i don''t think i have done better than this.  conveying an old practice and yet in a very incocuous guise. try and establish the parameters of creativity which led to the creation of this image.  if you can find that comfort zone again... anything is truely possible... beyond the scope of these words to convey it.', '2005-10-11 07:22:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1776101, 237872, 42392, '<td valign="top">i thought this was a great picture and i would not change anything about it. great color and the feel like you are there. this would be a print you could hang on your wall. i gave it a 10.</td>', 'i thought this was a great picture and i would not change anything about it. great color and the feel like you are there. this would be a print you could hang on your wall. i gave it a 10.', '2005-10-11 10:23:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1776108, 239408, 24995, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and I am so envious. I have tried to get this shot at least 15 different times. I am so afraid of long exposures because of the mist. You must have done this from one of the towers. That must be the secret. Ground level is just too wet at night.</td>', 'Beautiful, and I am so envious. I have tried to get this shot at least 15 different times. I am so afraid of long exposures because of the mist. You must have done this from one of the towers. That must be the secret. Ground level is just too wet at night.', '2005-10-11 10:26:07.000000', NULL, 0),
