(1780750, 238797, 36141, '<td valign="top">WOW, you were quick to tell me by pm you didn''t like my comment on your photo. Well, I don''t like nasty pm''s, so I deleted it from the server.<br/>Remains the fact that I don''t like crooked horizons. Just a matter of opinion. As I said before, it''s a beautiful mill.<br/>By the way: I really don''t care about numbers, therefor a 6+ average doesn''t mean a thing to me.<br/> <br/>But...despite that I stick to my own opinion, I''m still a nice person, so...congrats on the ribbon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-12 22:18:49.</i></td>', 'WOW, you were quick to tell me by pm you didn''t like my comment on your photo. Well, I don''t like nasty pm''s, so I deleted it from the server.Remains the fact that I don''t like crooked horizons. Just a matter of opinion. As I said before, it''s a beautiful mill.By the way: I really don''t care about numbers, therefor a 6+ average doesn''t mean a thing to me. But...despite that I stick to my own opinion, I''m still a nice person, so...congrats on the ribbon.', '2005-10-12 19:56:09.000000', '2005-10-12 23:18:49.000000', 0),
