(1781155, 238797, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is such a fantastic shot!  I know the horizon has been mentioned before, so I''m gonna leave that alone, but dude, you nailed it - congrats again on your blue!!!  WTG!!!  I''m really happy for you!<br/> <br/>EDIT:  Having been to Kinderdijk before myself, I think you captured its essence beautifully.  Such a magnificent locale.  Great job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-12 22:54:49.</i></td>', 'This is such a fantastic shot!  I know the horizon has been mentioned before, so I''m gonna leave that alone, but dude, you nailed it - congrats again on your blue!!!  WTG!!!  I''m really happy for you! EDIT:  Having been to Kinderdijk before myself, I think you captured its essence beautifully.  Such a magnificent locale.  Great job!', '2005-10-12 23:52:57.000000', '2005-10-12 23:54:49.000000', 0),
