(1802652, 238417, 35517, '<td valign="top">congrats on a great finish P.. although im dissapointed it didn''t finish higher.. it''s perfect... the lighting is as good as it gets.... the comp is the same.. perfect... i just wish dpc''ers, would take a little more time to look at a photo when voting and really ''see'' a photo, not just browse it....</td>', 'congrats on a great finish P.. although im dissapointed it didn''t finish higher.. it''s perfect... the lighting is as good as it gets.... the comp is the same.. perfect... i just wish dpc''ers, would take a little more time to look at a photo when voting and really ''see'' a photo, not just browse it....', '2005-10-22 03:29:09.000000', NULL, 0),
