(1817980, 239513, 34659, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the shot''s simplicity - it really adds to the overall midwest farmland theme.  My only nitpick would be that the colors seem a little drab (okay I guess that could support the midwest farmland theme too - lol), but I think a little burning might make them a little deeper and more interesting.  :-)  Great shot.</td>', 'I like the composition and the shot''s simplicity - it really adds to the overall midwest farmland theme.  My only nitpick would be that the colors seem a little drab (okay I guess that could support the midwest farmland theme too - lol), but I think a little burning might make them a little deeper and more interesting.  :-)  Great shot.', '2005-10-27 13:43:24.000000', NULL, 0),
