(1829984, 239433, 19831, '<td valign="top">A pretty cool action shot. Exposure and focus are pretty good. I like the angle and framing you''ve used. The water flow and the kayak go nicely vertical left to right through the shot, I think this helps create a good sense of movement and action, you get a good feel of what''s going on. Placement of the subject is good, and with the color of the boat, my attention is definitely drawn to it. <br/> <br/>I can''t say of ways to improve, I''ve not had experience doing action shots like this. It looks pretty good to me. I read your comment about people ''getting'' it. I''ve looked and looked, to see if there is something about it that I''m not seeing :-)  (if there is, let me know, I''m curious)</td>', 'A pretty cool action shot. Exposure and focus are pretty good. I like the angle and framing you''ve used. The water flow and the kayak go nicely vertical left to right through the shot, I think this helps create a good sense of movement and action, you get a good feel of what''s going on. Placement of the subject is good, and with the color of the boat, my attention is definitely drawn to it.  I can''t say of ways to improve, I''ve not had experience doing action shots like this. It looks pretty good to me. I read your comment about people ''getting'' it. I''ve looked and looked, to see if there is something about it that I''m not seeing :-)  (if there is, let me know, I''m curious)', '2005-11-01 13:59:59.000000', NULL, 0),
