(1872522, 236666, 42456, '<td valign="top">I lived in Oregon for five years in the late 90''s and I''ve seen a large number of Multnomah Falls images and after awhile they all start looking the same, but this one...I like the work you put into this one. It gave a new a refreshing look that kept my eyes moving through the verticals, picking up the action in the diagonals and the X pattern from corner to corner gives the illusion of a butterfly...at least that''s what I saw!! Great Shot!!!</td>', 'I lived in Oregon for five years in the late 90''s and I''ve seen a large number of Multnomah Falls images and after awhile they all start looking the same, but this one...I like the work you put into this one. It gave a new a refreshing look that kept my eyes moving through the verticals, picking up the action in the diagonals and the X pattern from corner to corner gives the illusion of a butterfly...at least that''s what I saw!! Great Shot!!!', '2005-11-16 10:35:29.000000', NULL, 0),
