(1978238, 237985, 39629, '<td valign="top">This shot was taken from the middle of Lake Taupo Forest, which is on the eastern shores of Lake Taupo in the middle of the North Island of New Zealand.   At the time I was working in the forestry area and saw a great sunset coming down, I had to really fly to find a high point where I could get the views of the mountain.<br/>Mt Ruapehu is a popular ski resort area in N.Z  and for those interested <br/>nearby you have the spectacular Tongariro Crossing, an alpine trekking route, awesome scenery, awesome park, which is rated as a world heritage park<br/>I do have some photos taken a couple of years back of the "crossing" which i will locate and put up for viewers</td>', 'This shot was taken from the middle of Lake Taupo Forest, which is on the eastern shores of Lake Taupo in the middle of the North Island of New Zealand.   At the time I was working in the forestry area and saw a great sunset coming down, I had to really fly to find a high point where I could get the views of the mountain.Mt Ruapehu is a popular ski resort area in N.Z  and for those interested nearby you have the spectacular Tongariro Crossing, an alpine trekking route, awesome scenery, awesome park, which is rated as a world heritage parkI do have some photos taken a couple of years back of the "crossing" which i will locate and put up for viewers', '2005-12-26 04:40:23.000000', NULL, 0),
