(2361426, 239172, 7703, '<td valign="top">Skemmtileg mynd af Bolungarvík. Ég hef aldrei nennt að ganga þarna niður í fjöruna en núna þarf ég þess ekki því þú tókst mynd sem ég get bara séð hvernig það lítur út þaðan. En flott hjá þér.</td>', 'Skemmtileg mynd af Bolungarvík. Ég hef aldrei nennt að ganga þarna niður í fjöruna en núna þarf ég þess ekki því þú tókst mynd sem ég get bara séð hvernig það lítur út þaðan. En flott hjá þér.', '2006-04-30 09:19:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2413256, 237879, 36628, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for a good dreamy kind of post processing, and this shot works really well with it. The curves of the horse and the lines of the tree are really well seen through the glow, and the tree frames the horse really well. The left side of the frame, though, seems kind of empty. Theres no tree and no horse, and those seem to be the main focus of the shot. I think with a little tighter crop this would be absolutly perfect!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for a good dreamy kind of post processing, and this shot works really well with it. The curves of the horse and the lines of the tree are really well seen through the glow, and the tree frames the horse really well. The left side of the frame, though, seems kind of empty. Theres no tree and no horse, and those seem to be the main focus of the shot. I think with a little tighter crop this would be absolutly perfect!', '2006-05-14 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
